          "id": "1694b6cef2975a4c38bf4e5d1bbe044d932760ea",
          "message": "Introduce a flag for binary dev tools (#11613)\n\n* Introduce a flag for binary dev tools\n\nSometimes the ocaml-lsp binary distro doesn't work. This would need some investigation to find the reason. Meanwhile, this PR introduces a new flag to disable it if needed.\n\nSigned-off-by: Sudha Parimala <sudharg247@gmail.com>\n\n* Address review comments\n\nSigned-off-by: Sudha Parimala <sudharg247@gmail.com>\n\n* Format code\n\nSigned-off-by: Sudha Parimala <sudharg247@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Sudha Parimala <sudharg247@gmail.com>",
