          "message": "simplify implementation of dune exec further (#11641)\n\n* test: dune exec failing program\n\nWe test how `dune exec` interacts with failing programs.\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor(exec): explode exec_context\n\nThere is no good reason for this module to exist. We explode it's\ncontents and simplify the implementation of dune exec.\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor(exec): simplify run_once\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor(exec): simplify exec watch step\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor: make dune exec use Process.run\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* refactor(exec): inline run_once and run_eagar_watch\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* fix: dune exec exits with correct exit code\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* test(exec): switch segfault test to KILL signal\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* test(exec): disable signal test\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>",
