          "id": "59fe9136035884322616db4219283425341351a5",
          "message": "Support odoc 3's hierarchy when installing files (#11800)\n\n* Add support for the files field in documentation stanza\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Add documentation for the `file` field of the `documentation` stanza\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* fix assets being tried to be compiled\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* improve tests\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Warn users when ignoring files when building docs\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Fix test output on mac\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Clarify that a string represents the name of an mld\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Improve wording in warning\n\nCo-authored-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot Anglès d'Auriac <peada@free.fr>\n\n* _\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>\n\n* _\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>\n\n* Promote typo fix in test\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Fix bug introduced by 1377833b1\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Documentation review\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Extract and deduplicate function\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Deduplicate doc files\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Add docs for doc_sources\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Law of demeter (but for FP)\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Document name field in odoc driving\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Small refactor\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Adding new line at end of files\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Unix neckbeard commit\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Deduplicating information\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Handle `.foo.mld`\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Avoid polymorphic equality\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Fix warnings in case of unsupported feture\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Fix programming typo from db758d9ab\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Promote missing test\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Fix an ordering for unsupported doc warning\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Add trailing new lines\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n* Clarify comment\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot <peada@free.fr>\nSigned-off-by: Paul-Elliot Anglès d'Auriac <peada@free.fr>\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>\nCo-authored-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>\nCo-authored-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
