          "id": "0150e32513556af8929773e027b690ad04c28142",
          "message": "pkg: lock utop dev tool before setting up utop rules (#12073)\n\nThis reverts commit 6c8a5a339c7cdbcda6cc70ba0556fc5eec765977 which\nlocked utop in a separate fiber scheduler run. Instead we just make sure\nthat the lockdir is created (if necessary) before loading the utop\nrules, which happens as a side effect of checking whether the utop exe\nexists, and _has_ the side effect of checking and memoizing whether the\nutop lockdir exists.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
          "timestamp": "2025-07-28T21:32:49+10:00",
          "tree_id": "8641251527ca1e74ad051fd9152dc8ac4b5c376e",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/0150e32513556af8929773e027b690ad04c28142"
