          "id": "9ecd6ed3e6b62aba6e27f3fa0e63b6af7e87f441",
          "message": "Remove locs from slangs in [Action.remove_locs] (#12514)\n\nFixes a bug where we weren't properly removing locations from actions.\nSlang expressions that are parsed from files contain locations, and\nthese location were not being removed from actions.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
          "timestamp": "2025-09-29T23:37:13+10:00",
          "tree_id": "8e1afc5ee29170d324a91d33ce7b6df13bc63ca4",
