          "message": "Fix `dune install --create-install-files` not being able to overwrite opam files (#12542)\n\n* test: execute build instructions in opam files\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonin Décimo <antonin@tarides.com>\n\n* Fix dune install --create-install-files not overwriting opam files\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonin Décimo <antonin@tarides.com>\n\n* Update changelog\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonin Décimo <antonin@tarides.com>\n\n* test: fix dune install requiring a mandir\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonin Décimo <antonin@tarides.com>\n\n* Introduce Io.overwrite_file\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonin Décimo <antonin@tarides.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonin Décimo <antonin@tarides.com>",
