          "id": "f3c70f02279388daa742e56371bfc5eb5261a4b6",
          "message": "Deduplicate opam parse errors (#12670)\n\nGenerating portable lockdirs requires running the solver several times,\npossibly in parallel. Errors parsing opam files would be printed\nmultiple times. This change threads result types through some of the\nsolver logic so errors can be collected and deduplicated before\nprinting.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
          "timestamp": "2025-11-06T18:57:41+11:00",
