          "id": "3f102c6dd3520a7322e39ab7951c1a81dff0a9d7",
          "message": "fix(spawn): fix headers issues on non-glibc (#10256)\n\n`caml/signals.h` is not public API; it does not include `caml/config.h`\r\nand so it will not include `signal.h` because it does not know about\r\n`POSIX_SIGNAL`. This issue is visible on musl as \"unknown type\r\nsigset_t\".\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>",
          "timestamp": "2024-03-12T13:49:44+01:00",
          "tree_id": "c6e0a91627de0b29fd7dc76394137543c70437bc",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/3f102c6dd3520a7322e39ab7951c1a81dff0a9d7"
