          "distinct": true,
          "id": "9f3da04c1c27ff80e8d1ab71de15c53a0ca953da",
          "message": "docs: use furo theme (#10786)\n\n* docs: use furo theme\r\n\r\nThis theme has several advantages compared to `sphinx_rtd_theme`:\r\n\r\n- support for light and dark mode\r\n- a sidebar on the right with a table of contents for the current\r\n  documentation\r\n- better use of horizontal space (half of the screen is unused with\r\n  `sphinx_rtd_theme`)\r\n- \"it looks better\"\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n* use sphinx >= 6\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>\r\n\r\n---------\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Etienne Millon <me@emillon.org>",
          "timestamp": "2024-08-02T10:28:46+02:00",
          "tree_id": "68e54a1ee469108220a124dcb516a7281190bf26",
