          "message": "pkg: handle case where dune violates project deps (#11554)\n\nIf a project depends on the \"dune\" package with constraints that are not\nsatisfied by the currently-running instance of Dune, Dune is unable to\nsolve the project. This should be a user error as this behaviour can be\ntriggered by user action.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
