          "message": "fix: dune exec not updating arg0 (#11559)\n\n`Proc.restore_cwd_and_execve` now ensures argv[0] is the actual prog passed. This value is essentially ignored by Unix and is really a convention.\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>",
