          "message": "feat: add extra_objects field to foreign_library stanza (#11683)\n\n* refactor(dune_lang): tidy up extra_objects\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* chore: better name for extra_o_files\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* feature: add extra_objects field to foreign_library stanza\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* feat: (:include) support for extra_objects in foreign_library\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* test: non-existent file, object file with foreign_library extra_objects\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* doc: foreign_library extra_objects\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n* doc: add changelog for #11683\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>",
