          "id": "1b0525104d2ec4287f6c7cde4bac44a4fb7dbafa",
          "message": "fix(pkg): handle empty ID_LIKE (#11726)\n\nOn NixOS for whatever reason `ID_LIKE` was an empty string. In this case\nwe shouldn't use it to find the `os_family` and instead fallback to the\n`os_distribution`.\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>",
