          "message": "Don't solve for windows arm64 by default (#12641)\n\nWindows arm64 is not widely used. Currently generating portable lockdirs\nrequires running the solver for each of a configurable list of\nplatforms. Removing windows arm64 from the default platform list will\nspeed up solving for most users by avoiding generating a solution that\nfew people will be able to use.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
