          "distinct": true,
          "id": "59dd56f72e40c515cafaaf65d80822ed10fc53c5",
          "message": "Portable lockdirs by default (#12680)\n\n* Enable portable lockdirs by default\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>\n\n* Update tests to expect portable lockdirs\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>\n\n* Stop setting feature flag in portable lockdir tests\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>\n\n* Update autolock test to allow rebuilds\n\nRebuilds happen because the internal package solution generated when\nautolocking is specialized to the current platform. This allows building\non platforms which portable lockdirs don't support by default, however\nit means that packages built from a pre-existing portable lockdir need\nto be rebuilt with the new build plan.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
          "timestamp": "2025-11-13T14:02:10+11:00",
