          "message": "Log solution improvements (#12898)\n\n@Sudha247 mentioned that the dependencies are output in a fairly ugly\nway. So this adds a test to show that the solution is logged in\nalphabetic order (that was already the case, just not exercised by the\ntest) and improves the code to use `Pp.enumerate`, matching the output\ncloser to what `dune pkg lock` does.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>",
