          "message": "fix(cram): lexing of single space comment after output (#12903)\n\nThis PR fixes the regression reported in\nhttps://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/12899.\n\nThe first commit adds a regression test for a command block followed by\na comment starting with a single space. Previously the comment would be\ndropped.\n\nThe second commit fixes this issue and renames the function in the lexer\nto make it clearer.\n\n- fix https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/12899",
