          "id": "bc1f5c4bb6b61e7970e4f5032f59aebc81181536",
          "message": "Document what `dev` is used for (#13126)\n\nI was wondering why `(dev)` is recorded in lockdirs and @Alizter checked\nwhat it is used for. This adds the result to the type so next time\nsomeone is wondering the answer is easy to find.\n\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>",
