          "id": "ed2a6e0a258fae0a272863d536539a42636aedbf",
          "message": "refactor: rewrite parser generator ml sources as a function of the stanzas (#13167)\n\nI made a mistake when implementing this by indexing the source tree for\n`.ml{l,y}` files, when to Dune they're only a function of the respective\nstanza.\n\nThis caused more problems as I was porting the Menhir rules. This\nreverts a lot of the code in favor of a simpler implementation.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonio Nuno Monteiro <anmonteiro@gmail.com>",
