          "message": "refactor(boot): simplify handling of architecture values. (#12469)\n\nSince we parse architecture values from the config, we might as well\ncollapse `amd64` and `x86_64` since these are the same.\n\nWe also simplify the various places we handle architectures to use the\nsame (poly) variant. This allows us to simplify some other parts and\nshare some code.",
