          "id": "59c358eae43e38d2a52c6fb4c9fbfd51372b15d4",
          "message": "[OxCaml] Tutorial for library parameter (#12111)\n\nThis PR is ready for review.\n\nThe tutorial aims to follow a simple flow to go through all the\npossibilities provided by parameterized libraries. It covers the entire\n\"diamond\" of the parameterized library, i.e.:\n\n```ascii\n    parameter\n   /         \\\nimplement   parameterized\n   \\         /\n    instance\n```\n\nThe tutorial covers:\n- Setting up a project\n- Writing a parameter\n- Writing the implementation of the parameter\n- Writing a parameterized library\n- Instantiate a parameterized library",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-26T16:18:45-05:00",
          "tree_id": "9d30fac6f7690a122dd1771e3898d12e09a43757",
