          "distinct": true,
          "id": "1a450a30bbd3173d43a48f09d226504f5bb60466",
          "message": "nix: add revdeps output (#13222)\n\nThis patch adds a way for any OCaml package from nixpkgs to be built\nusing this dune.\n\nBuild single package using current dune:\n```\nnix build .#revdeps.x86_64-linux.lwt --override-input revdeps-dune path:.\n```\n\nBuild `base` and `core` using dune 3.20.2\n```\nnix build .#revdeps.x86_64-linux.{base,core} --override-input revdeps-dune github:ocaml/dune/3.20.2\n\n```\n\nBuild all OCaml packages (continue past failures) for 3.21.0~alpha5:\n```\nnix build .#revdeps.x86_64-linux.all --override-input revdeps-dune github:ocaml/dune/3.21.0_alpha5\n```\n\nWe also add two manually workflows:\n- `revdeps.yml` for building particular packages\n- `revdeps-bisect.yml` for git bisecting an error between two commits of\ndune",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-27T14:40:59+01:00",
          "tree_id": "45fbb4c67302712e9f3ebaced97d2efce7d44da8",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/1a450a30bbd3173d43a48f09d226504f5bb60466"
