          "message": "chore: add lib dependency on dune_config_file (#13527)\n\nI only noticed that this was under-specified on 4.14. Not sure what\nOCaml 5.4 is doing that we don't need to explicitly depend on this. My\nguess is that the module alias resolution is a little stronger.\n\nThe `@unused-lib` alias doesn't seem to complain.\n\nThis doesn't affect the bootstrap because we don't do libraries here.",
