          "id": "98b7042fc4e843187648cea1bdfdc7c615f720a5",
          "message": "Repro case for #12311 (#13434)\n\nThis is a reproduction of the bug reported in #12311. I played around\nwith the pretty printer a bit, but unfortunately, I haven't figured out\na reliable way to print a new line after \"Hint:\", so I don't have a\nbetter suggestion than #12312. It seems the pretty printer breaks after\nHint only if the full line is over a certain length, which is not the\ncase in the example in this patch.\n\nIf we're ok with just reliably breaking after the `You may want to\nverify the following depexts are installed:` line, I'll add it to this\nPR.",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-16T11:49:26+01:00",
          "tree_id": "bd7331ad3d1e426a3c1f68521122dba9b883015e",
