          "message": "feat(oxcaml): jsoo support for parameterised libs (#13414)\n\nCloses https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/12564\n\nBetter support than https://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/12762 since\n@hhugo fixed [the `js_of_ocaml` support for OxCaml parameterised\nlibs](https://github.com/ocsigen/js_of_ocaml/pull/2105/commits/c3da0bb58eafe2d9ad3387cbbe9b8faf9ec91fb1)\nto enable separate compilation!\n\n(Builds on top of a small refactoring\nhttps://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/13413 , only the last commit is\nrelevant... Although the code works, I'm marking this PR as a draft\nsince the CI is expected to fail until the oxcaml opam-repo ships jsoo\nwith the fix)",
