          "id": "987884283c5f17facccdbe3df301b5bbca959793",
          "message": "fix(pkg): better hint for depexts (#13636)\n\nInstead of using Pp.enumerate and having to wrangle it's formatting\ninside of a hint, let's just give the users what they want, which is\ntypically a space deliminated list of depexts. This makes it easy to\ncopy and paste into their system package manager command.\n\n- Fixes #12311",
