          "message": "fix(rev_store): only negotiate with relevant tips (#13698)\n\nAs discussed in #13671, we restrict how we negotiate from the rev_store\nto a server to use only the relevant tips.\n\n- Fixes #13671\n\nThis is done by name spacing the recorded references by (the hash of)\ntheir URL. This way we can provide only the relevant references during\nnegotiation.\n\nThis should both speed up negotiation (and hence downloads) and avoid\nunnecessary communication of rev_store contents.\n\n`--negotiation-tip` is an argument that was introduced in the minimum\nsupported Git version that we currently have.\n\nI've updated the doc/dev/rev_store.md about this new behaviour.",
