          "id": "9a3f7d81032b818ea3358f48afd19f4c4cf8fa0b",
          "message": "fix: use open_out_bin in configure to avoid CRLF on Windows (#13838)\n\n`open_out` will replace newlines with carriage return new lines on\nWindows. We can avoid this by using `open_out_bin` instead. This avoid\nunnecessary promotions that happen on Windows where carriage returns are\nadded to `src/dune_rules/setup.defaults.ml`.",
