          "id": "af0da5307d9aab13631f17a7252c236a59d36de4",
          "message": "feature: allow diffing directories (#13880)\n\nAllow the `diff` action to diff directories. Some situations where such\nan action is useful:\n\n1. We'd like to introduce a generic \"test\" rule that will read test\ncases from a directory and produce test output for every individual test\ncase.\n\n2. We have a code generator that produces for multiple source files.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
