          "distinct": true,
          "id": "41800e979a599ecd973914736da8c9ca6ddb8730",
          "message": "pkg: improve unsupported opam variable translation errors (#13954)\n\nImproves error messages for unsupported opam variables during\nopam-to-dune translation.\n\nInstead of only saying a variable is “not supported,” Dune now explains\nthat it cannot translate that opam variable and clarifies that only a\nsubset of opam variables is currently supported. This gives users\nclearer context when errors point to generated/internal opam locations.\n\nIncludes updated blackbox test expectations for unsupported variable\ncases.\n\nFixes #13784\n\nSigned-off-by: Meet Zalavadiya <zalavadiyameet0806@gmail.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-29T20:13:38+01:00",
          "tree_id": "b658311541105ff5002c85ad698ed7f3ab412877",
