          "distinct": true,
          "id": "ac74b1a3ffb5a2c5798930fbafd71320c630d1c3",
          "message": "test: verify %{lib:...} works in flags stanzas (#14146)\n\n## Summary\n\nCloses #3362.\n\n`%{lib:...}` used to produce `%{lib:..} isn't allowed in this position`\nwhen used in `(flags)` or `(ocamlopt_flags)` stanzas. This restriction\nhas since been removed — the error message no longer exists in the\ncodebase.\n\nThis PR adds a regression test proving the pform now expands correctly\nin both rule actions and flags stanzas.\n\nSigned-off-by: Robin Bate Boerop <me@robinbb.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-12T09:02:21+01:00",
          "tree_id": "1e85e0a72845a702ab257912f8b5ccfe9b34fa9e",
