          "id": "75090d1a414ebb3ab6d0d070cbaca487ff33a0c1",
          "message": "test: verify libexec site install sets executable bit (#11110) (#14171)\n\n## Summary\n\nCloses #11110.\n\nThe reported issue (custom `libexec` sites not setting the executable\nbit) is not reproducible on current `main`. The `libexec` site correctly\nmaps to the `libexec_root` section in the `.install` file, and `dune\ninstall` sets `0o755` permissions.\n\nThis PR adds a test confirming the correct behavior so it doesn't\nregress.\n\nSigned-off-by: Robin Bate Boerop <me@robinbb.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-13T11:39:57+01:00",
          "tree_id": "3a1d3a585c10e242ff0c65641a9469f3fcdc37b7",
