          "message": "test: verify .h files are not copied to _build without foreign stubs (#2370) (#14172)\n\n## Summary\n\nCloses #2370.\n\nThe reported issue (`.h` files eagerly copied to `_build` even without C\nstubs) is no longer reproducible on current `main`. Header files are now\nonly copied when `foreign_stubs` is configured.\n\nThis PR adds a regression test confirming the correct behavior.",
