          "id": "4367b26cf5d7eedc46e3e94ea964671aa8a3d8e6",
          "message": "lev: fix boxed values returned by C stubs (#14285)\n\n`Backend.supported` and related stubs return immediate integers, so\nthose results need `Val_int`.\n\n`Timer.remaining` returns `Timestamp.t`, which is represented as a boxed\nfloat, so the stub must use `caml_copy_double`.\n\nAdd expect tests covering both cases.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
