          "message": "fix(rpc): wait for listener shutdown to complete (#14322)\n\nMake Csexp_rpc.Server.stop wait until the listening sockets are closed\nand the accept loop has finished before returning.\n\nStop the RPC server before shutting down the scheduler, and add coverage\nfor rejecting new connections after shutdown along with the updated\nwatch-mode shutdown trace ordering.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
