          "id": "83fd77c90ff7d6559c5158f39e52f6ff50033be4",
          "message": "copilot-setup-steps: add Nix dev shell setup, CI cache restore, and Copilot instructions (#14321)\n\nSets up the Copilot coding agent environment for this repository with a\nNix dev shell, CI cache integration, and agent instructions.\n\n## Changes Made\n\n- **New workflow file** — creates\n`.github/workflows/copilot-setup-steps.yml` with steps to install Nix\n(`nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action@v34`) and warm the dev shell via\n`nix develop -c true`\n- **Nix cache restore** — wires in `nix-community/cache-nix-action@v7`\nusing the same primary key and fallback prefix pattern\n(`nix-Linux-nix-test--`) as the main CI job, so the warmed Nix store is\nreused rather than rebuilt\n- **Restore-only** (`save: false`) — setup steps consume the CI cache\nbut never write their own entry, keeping cache management solely in CI\n- **Copilot instructions** — adds `.github/copilot-instructions.md` that\nlinks to `AGENTS.md` for full development guidance and documents the\nNix-specific requirements:\n- First-time setup: `nix develop -c make bootstrap` (required once on a\nfresh checkout before any other commands)\n- All common build/test/format commands shown with the `nix develop -c`\nprefix",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-25T10:38:40+01:00",
          "tree_id": "d402df431b6bf0e01996422743e3af4d21919bc9",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/83fd77c90ff7d6559c5158f39e52f6ff50033be4"
