          "message": "test(cram): add test for switching cram test from directory to file (#14369)\n\nWhen a directory cram test produces a diff, the .corrected path in\n_build is a\ndirectory. Switching to a file cram test then fails with:\n  Error: rename(_build/default/mytest.t.corrected): Is a directory\n\nExisting tests (working-directory-cram-github6575.t) only cover\nswitching\nwithout a diff, and promote-file-to-dir.t only covers the\nfile-to-directory\ndirection. This test covers tests cover the missing cases.",
