          "id": "32c94970fb1d2313ecb13a78a71071d4ed8afd84",
          "message": "Rocq `(no_corelib)` flag (#14452)\n\nThis PR is to address #14358.\n\nThis PR deprecates the somewhat confusing `(stdlib (yes|no))` flag in\nRocq language version 0.14+ and replaces it:\n- For `(stdlib no)` utilize `(no_corelib)` instead\n- For `(stdlib yes)` no flag is required and it is just the default\nbehavior",
