          "id": "5f176c976580a99e3178651a5e1c3676bba3e03c",
          "message": "Represent action arguments as appendable lists (#14602)\n\nStore command-line arguments in action Run nodes as Appendable_list.t\ninstead of immutable arrays. This lets command construction pass\nalready-appendable argument sequences through without materializing\narrays.\n\nAdd Appendable_list.map, length, and iter helpers, and update action\nmapping, digesting, execution, and printing to consume the new\nrepresentation.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
