          "message": "test(top-module): reproduce over-rebuild on unreferenced lib's .mli change (#14476)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds a regression test under\n`test/blackbox-tests/test-cases/top-module/` that reproduces a `dune\nocaml top-module` over-rebuild: editing the interface of a library\nreferenced only from `.mli` (never from `.ml`) rebuilds the top-module\nartefact, even though `top-module` drops the `.mli`. The test passes\ntoday while the bug is present.\n\nRelated: #14477.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Robin Bate Boerop <me@robinbb.com>",
