          "message": "Handle RPC socket preparation failures (#14612)\n\nMake Socket.prepare_fd return a result when applying the macOS\nno-SIGPIPE option fails. Close the fd on that failure and propagate the\nerror through accepted server sockets and client transport creation.\n\nAvoid redundant preparation for sessions and listening sockets that have\nalready been prepared.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
