          "message": "refactor(dune_rules): move odoc rules files in subdir (#14615)\n\nThis is the first PR of an attempt (lead by @art-w and me) to break\n@jonludlam's #12995 into multiple, digestible PRs.\n\n(#12995 is a very big PR upgrading the odoc rules, with multiple\nenhancements and unlocking many odoc 3 features.)\n\nThis PR is a simple refactor, moving all odoc-related rule files into\ntheir own directory. The number of odoc-related files is already\nrelatively big, and it will grow in later PRs, so it is probably better\nto organize them in a directory.",
