          "id": "39c592190df0f7c7ac03eaea8815be7083430061",
          "message": "test: cmx native deps under release profile (#14583)\n\nRegression guard asserting that a consumer of a tight-eligible local\nlibrary builds correctly when forced through the native `.cmx` path via\n`--profile release`.\n\nThe default `dev` profile sets `opaque = true`, which makes `want_cmx =\nfalse` for local libs and the cmx branch is skipped entirely. Switching\nto `release` flips `opaque` off, so the consumer's native compile takes\nthe per-module path with `cm_kind = Ocaml Cmx` and the function records\ncmx-file deps.\n\nSigned-off-by: Robin Bate Boerop <me@robinbb.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-20T12:45:58-07:00",
          "tree_id": "cf5b3f7264238fbab32a21244c87b9547da26136",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/39c592190df0f7c7ac03eaea8815be7083430061"
