          "message": "chore: use opam-based revdeps tests (#14538)\n\nThe nix-based revdeps tests never worked for us: including packages that\ndon't build per se and so give false positives, and nix derivations that\nrequire unnecessary system deps (like emacs).\n\nIn any case, the point of this test is to be an early warning sign for\nthe opam-ci, so we should be using opam. Opam is used here, and we also\ninstall `--with-test`, to get the benefit of running several test\nsuites.\n\nFixes https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/13897\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Shon Feder <shon.feder@gmail.com>",
