          "id": "1297a83bdf81b03b01267f18ed6402903d0aab2f",
          "message": "Keep watch changed paths out of the scheduler (#14669)\n\nThe polling build loop already consumes memo invalidations before\nstarting a new iteration, so the scheduler does not need to store\nchanged paths just to report them back to build tracing.\n\nHave the scheduler track only whether a build is a restart, and drop the\nchanged file list from build-start trace events. The restart reasons are\nstill reported by build-restart events.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-23T10:24:54+02:00",
