          "id": "b3e3117e3a4a02c420093adbee8e902d28a51e31",
          "message": "Fix Windows watcher sync handling (#14678)\n\nThe Windows watcher was the only backend that did not create the sync\ndirectory during setup, so emit_sync could fail when the directory was\nmissing.\n\nIt also consumed sync events directly from the watcher thread. Other\nbackends defer that work to the scheduler thread because the sync table\nis maintained there; doing the same on Windows avoids racing with\nemit_sync and keeps the table single-threaded.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-24T09:31:32+02:00",
          "tree_id": "4336bb3762f34b763f1f74ed999267a9bf92c30e",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/b3e3117e3a4a02c420093adbee8e902d28a51e31"
