          "id": "8280544623f15e91788acf8e9cbc6a6d7554a561",
          "message": "Send file watcher events directly to the scheduler (#14674)\n\nFile watcher callbacks now construct event lists before sending them\nthrough the scheduler hook, removing the intermediate queued thunk path.\n\nProtect fs sync bookkeeping with a mutex shared with the inotify watcher\nso sync events can be consumed safely from watcher threads.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
