          "message": "feat(show): include directories with targets in dune show targets (#14665)\n\nWalk the `allowed_subdirs` of the loaded directory and surface those\ncontaining build targets in the listing. Add an `-a`/`--all` flag to\nalso include hidden directories (those starting with `.`).\n\nStacked on #14664. The `refactor(show): add ls_term_gen to support extra\narguments` commit is a prerequisite refactor that will be reviewed\nalongside this change.\n\n- Fixes #13783\n- [x] changelog\n- [x] docs",
