          "message": "fix(thread_pool): update accounting on task failure (#14703)\n\nWhen a task raises, mark the worker as dead, decrement the running\ncount, and unlock before raising the code error.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
