          "id": "151b39336f41fce2341a4ee5570b9311154368b5",
          "message": "Fix FSEvents dispatch queue wakeups (#14730)\n\nWait for dispatch queue shutdown with a predicate loop so missed\nbroadcasts and spurious condition-variable wakeups cannot make\nwait_until_stopped return too early or block forever. Add a regression\ntest for stopping a stream before waiting on the dispatch queue.\n\nKeep the callback exception global root alive until dispatch queue\nfinalization, and read/write the OCaml exception value while holding the\nOCaml runtime lock.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-25T23:21:23+02:00",
          "tree_id": "0c1dfd6ea6ed737d9a6c0eba4e86201da7793cc0",
