          "id": "3e9cb9434e2058e6f26a5f965a24d674e287a740",
          "message": "Harden FSEvents stream creation (#14729)\n\nCheck for FSEventStreamCreate failure before storing the stream in the\nOCaml custom block. Initialize the callback field before registering it\nas a global root.\n\nIf FSEventStreamStart fails, roll back the dispatch queue stream count\nand clear the stream's dispatch queue pointer so later state remains\nconsistent. Also fix the unavailable-platform C stub for\ndune_fsevents_start to match the OCaml external arity.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
