          "id": "4de6ead3ae38d19db4f2b5df368cf7a3016a0342",
          "message": "test: document %{bin} and %{bin-available} behavior lock-kind contexts (#14736)\n\nThis test aims to capture the current behavior when expanding %{bin} and\n%{bin-available} pforms in the Lock-kind context. The expansion\ncurrently depends on `Pkg_rules.which` that currently scans every locked\npackage's binary index. So, any binary installed by any locked package\nis discoverable from any stanza.\n\nBut, this dependency also means that expanding these pforms has a\ndependency on building all the lockdir packages which is one of the\nproblems to be fixed in #8652",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-27T16:25:54+01:00",
          "tree_id": "f79016950f6ca13a819d05bd878e5be776cff473",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/4de6ead3ae38d19db4f2b5df368cf7a3016a0342"
