          "id": "072a23f2c777331fcab8fd368c2ebc8c7f1c0649",
          "message": "refactor(odoc): higher level artifacts representation (#14759)\n\nChange the `odoc_artefact` type, used to represent \"odoc artifacts\"\n(what I would call a \"compilation unit\", but it is good to use a\ndifferent name not to confuse with OCaml compilation units).\nBefore it was a record which only contained path for `.odoc`, `.odocl`,\n...\nNow, it is a higher level representation of artifacts. The paths in the\nold representation are computed from the higher level value.\n\nThis small refactor is part of #12995. The representation of artifacts\nis going to evolve in further commits, but this PR is the minimal\nrefactoring (and thus does not bring much value, just a change in\norganization).",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-27T20:41:11+01:00",
          "tree_id": "ced3061559a8fe63d4a29ff1a9ef8ed0010e5dee",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/072a23f2c777331fcab8fd368c2ebc8c7f1c0649"
