          "message": "refactor(memo): split [Changed_or_not] (#14955)\n\nPure refactor with no behavior change: extract the `Changed_or_not` type\nout\nof `memo.ml`/`deps.ml` into its own `Changed_or_not` module (with an\n`.mli`).\n\nThis is the first in a small series of internal `memo` refactors and\nimprovements; splitting it out on its own keeps each change easy to\nreview.\nNo user-facing behavior changes, so no changelog entry.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
