          "message": "fix: build on illumos (#14980)\n\nFixes #14182.\n\n- Handle Solaris/illumos `wait4(-1, ...)` semantics by using `wait4(0,\n...)`, matching `wait3` behavior.\n- Retry the spawn error-pipe `read` when interrupted by `EINTR`.\n\nTests:\n- `dune build @check`\n- `dune fmt`\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
