          "id": "9f8650617f37db0ab9e473c90feb0a510786e169",
          "message": "feat(memo): add Invalidation.custom and to_reason_list (#14987)\n\nAdds two additive helpers to `Memo.Invalidation`:\n\n- `Invalidation.custom ~reason ~f` builds an invalidation that runs an\narbitrary action `f` when applied — for out-of-band caching mechanisms\nthat need to hook into a build invalidation.\n- `Invalidation.to_reason_list` returns all reasons contributing to an\ninvalidation, deduplicated and in first-seen order.\n\nBoth are additive; the existing `reset` / `details_hum` behaviour is\nunchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
