          "id": "1fcfcde4666db3234405609da58e121a77c4038e",
          "message": "refactor(memo): move Value into its own module (#14998)\n\nExtract `Value` into its own module `src/memo/value.ml` (+ `.mli`).\n\nNow that cancellations are represented as non-reproducible errors,\n`Value.t` is a leaf type (`Ok | Error`) with no dependency on the node\ngraph, so it can live in its own module. To break the one remaining\ndependency — `Value`'s error-set comparison unwraps `Error.E`, which is\ndefined in `memo.ml` — the unwrapping function is installed by `memo.ml`\nat startup via a `Value.unwrap_exn` ref.\n\nPure code motion; behaviour is unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
