          "id": "689d4d21fa81ad12d7835e5f46327d7140301c13",
          "message": "refactor(memo): move the node graph's core types into node.ml (#15004)\n\nMove the node graph's core types into a new module `src/memo/node.ml`.\n\n`node.ml` holds the mutually-recursive core (`Dep_node`, `Cached_value`,\n`State`, `Cycle_error`, `Error`, `Cache_lookup`, the cycle-detection\n`Dag`, `Lazy_dag_node`, `Computation0`) together with their small\nimplementation modules, and installs `Value.unwrap_exn`. `memo.ml` now\n`open`s `Node` and re-exports the types it exposes.\n\nThe functions operating on these types (the execution engine, the\ncycle-detection call stack, etc.) stay in `memo.ml` for now and can move\nin follow-ups.\n\nPure code motion; behaviour is unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
