          "message": "Improve bytecode foreign stubs error hint (#14976)\n\nPure bytecode executables with direct foreign stubs are rejected, but\nbytecode executables can still use foreign stubs through a library.\nMention that supported layout in the error hints so users are not left\nthinking bytecode plus foreign stubs is impossible.\n\nFixes #6074.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
