          "message": "fix: clarify unsupported dune language version error (#15000)\n\nAvoid describing the dune language as an extension when the requested\n`(lang dune ...)` version is unsupported, and add upgrade/lower-version\nhints.\n\nTested with:\n\n```sh\ndune runtest test/blackbox-tests/test-cases/pkg/pin-stanza/unknown-dune-version.t\ndune build @check\n```\n\nFixes #14560.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
