          "id": "6f354bf1da34b3189f8fe0197930b2c78810c1a5",
          "message": "refactor(memo): move the call stack and computation into node.ml (#15036)\n\nMove the cycle-detection call stack (`Stack_frame_with_state`,\n`Call_stack`)\nand the `Computation` module from `memo.ml` into `node.ml`.\n\nThese build directly on the node-graph core types already in `node.ml`\n(the\n`Dag`, `Dep_node`, and computation state), so co-locating them keeps the\ndependency-graph machinery in one place and shrinks `memo.ml` further.\nThe\nexecution engine in `memo.ml` continues to use them unchanged.\n\nPure code motion; behaviour is unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
