          "message": "doc: clarify exe and bin variables (#15044)\n\nClarify that `%{exe:...}` refers to an in-tree executable by path and\ndoes not require the executable to have a public name or be installed,\nwhile `%{bin:...}` looks up a program by command name.\n\nCloses #4136.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
