          "id": "6fa426316b9022d6687b09e2bc600c983a9383d0",
          "message": "doc: clarify generated library module names (#15046)\n\nClarify that modules from the library generated by `dune init proj` are\nreferenced by their OCaml module names, for example `Project_name.Foo`,\nrather than by the literal lowercase project name.\n\nAlso mention that the generated tests can use the same library module\nnames.\n\nCloses #6551.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
