          "id": "eff5093e4b46864bab910119336b17eeccfa7d43",
          "message": "refactor(memo): fold a node's cutoff and event tracker into one field (#15082)\n\n`Spec.t` carried a memoized node's cutoff predicate and its\nevent-tracking\ncallback as two separate optional fields (`allow_cutoff` and\n`on_event`).\nReplace them with a single `Node_kind.t` — a flattened product of the\ntwo\noptions (`Vanilla` / `With_event_tracker` / `With_cutoff` /\n`With_cutoff_and_event_tracker`) — exposing `output_changed`,\n`has_cutoff`, and\n`notify`. Only a small fraction of nodes track events, so the flattened\nform\navoids an extra indirection on the common path.\n\nBehaviour-preserving.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
