          "message": "fix: clarify module conflict errors (#15072)\n\nClarify the diagnostic shown when a module is claimed by multiple\nstanzas. The new wording explains that stanzas without explicit\n`(modules ...)` fields claim modules by default and lists all affected\nstanza kinds, including `test`, `tests`, and `melange.emit`.\n\nCloses #6598.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
