          "id": "95b8da206ce2cb9423551b13b56d61328294c634",
          "message": "Improve RPC watch builds (#14954)\n\nMove watch-mode RPC build request tracking into Build_loop, replacing\nthe pending Job_queue with a request-id keyed table and per-request\ncompletion. New RPC requests now cancel and restart the current build so\nthey are folded into a combined request with the sticky watch goal;\none-shot RPC requests are removed on completion or connection\ntermination.\n\nExpose RPC request ids to server handlers so the RPC layer can map\nrequests to connections and cancel all outstanding requests when a\nclient disconnects. Update watch RPC tests for restart/cancellation\nbehavior.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-10T10:09:59+01:00",
