          "message": "feat(memo): add Deps.For_debugging.to_dyn (#15102)\n\nAdd a structural printer for the series-parallel dependency graph\n(`Deps.For_debugging.to_dyn`) that preserves the\n`Seq`/`Par`/`Singleton`/`Empty`\nnesting and intra-`Seq` order, unlike the existing `to_list` which\nflattens it.\nThis makes the dependency representation observable in tests.\n\nSecond of a short series adding regression coverage for recently-landed\nmemo\ninternals; it unblocks the dependency-representation test.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
