          "message": "feat(memo): add node.mli (#15124)\n\nAdd an interface for the foundational `node.ml` module - previously the\nonly memo\nmodule without one. It exposes node.ml's actual surface: the `module\nrec` core\n(the node-state types stay concrete, since consumers pattern-match on\nthem), the\nper-node helpers, and a top-level doc comment describing the node\nlifecycle /\n`State` transitions. `node.ml` is unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
