          "id": "08c963cabf2217944a391b788981f544bdd46fa9",
          "message": "test(memo): cover parallel cutoff-restore eagerness (#15123)\n\nAdd tests for how cache restore interacts with parallelism and cutoffs -\nthe\naltitude/eagerness contract. Via printf-interleaving across two runs\nthey assert\nthat during restore a no-cutoff node directly under a parallel section\nis eagerly\nrecomputed in parallel; a no-cutoff node inside a sequential section\nnested in a\nparallel one is not (it is deferred to the compute phase); eagerness\nre-enables\nunder a nested parallel section; and an error in an eagerly-recomputed\nnode\npropagates. Plus basic fork_and_join / parallel_map order-and-restore\ncases.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
