          "message": "test(memo): cover clear_caches and changed_paths (#15122)\n\nFor `clear_caches`: after a plain reset both memoized tables restore\nfrom cache with no recomputation,\nwhereas `reset (clear_caches ...)` empties every registered table and\nforces both\nto recompute. For `changed_paths`: it returns only the `Path_changed`\nreasons,\ndeduplicated and sorted, excluding non-path reasons.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
