          "id": "7233351318f7c7a7122ef34e47d68a0c95ee064a",
          "message": "refactor(memo): rename Cell to Node and Make_parallel_map to Map (#15139)\n\n## What\n\nRename the public memo cell API to the dependency-graph vocabulary:\n\n- `Memo.Cell` → `Memo.Node`, `Memo.cell` → `Memo.node`,\n`Memo.lazy_cell` → `Memo.lazy_node` (and `Cell.read`/`Cell.invalidate`/\n  `Cell.input` → `Node.read`/…).\n- the `Memo.Make_parallel_map` functor → `Memo.Map`.\n\nA \"cell\" is a handle to a node in the dependency graph, so `Node` names\nit\ndirectly; `Map` is the more concise name for the parallel-map functor.\n\nPure renaming — no behavioural change. `src/memo`, `bin/dune.exe`, and\nthe\nmemo test suite all build and pass unchanged.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
