          "message": "test(foreign-stubs): port archive creation checks to ppx expect (#15154)\n\nReplace the archive-creation-behavior cram test runner with an inline\nexpect-test library. The common helper creates temporary projects and\nruns %{bin:dune}; each wrapped/stubs combination has its own module so\nppx_inline_test can partition the cases and run them independently.\n\nThe four modules cover the effective wrapped/stubs combinations; the old\nmli-only dimension was redundant because the library stanza uses\n(modules ()).\n\nLike https://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/14376 but without the copy\npasting.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-11T23:43:35+01:00",
