          "message": "doc: clarify executable linking modes (#15184)\n\nClarify the executable linking mode reference:\n\n- mention up front that `byte_complete` is a special mode rather than a\n`(compilation-mode binary-kind)` pair\n- render the extension table in the generated documentation, including\n`.bc.exe`\n- clarify that `(modes byte)` also produces a compatibility\nself-contained `.exe` target when no `native`/`exe` mode is requested\n\nFixes #7866.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
