          "message": "test(watch): repro delayed concurrent RPC build completion (#15155)\n\nAdd a cram test showing that concurrent RPC builds for independent\ntargets currently complete together. The test gates fast and slow\nactions explicitly, releases the fast action first, observes that its\nRPC request still does not report success, then releases the slow action\nand verifies both requests finish.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
