          "id": "ca5c569c209a30ba1f138c1958b59861edcc4904",
          "message": "action-runner: retry worker RPC connection (#15260)\n\nHave action-runner workers retry connecting to the parent RPC server\nevery 0.1s until the server is ready, instead of failing immediately\nwhen the socket is not available yet.\n\nOnly retry ENOENT and ECONNREFUSED from the socket connect call. Other\nconnection failures, including invalid RPC addresses, are reported\nimmediately.\n\nWith connection retries in place, remove the lazy startup-order knot\nbetween spawning the worker and launching the RPC server.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-21T08:48:58+01:00",
          "tree_id": "ea0981205e3ca0e4369a53b8a441ce19513771ca",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/ca5c569c209a30ba1f138c1958b59861edcc4904"
