          "message": "chore(deps): bump nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action from 34 to 35 (#15280)\n\nBumps\n[nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action](https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action)\nfrom 34 to 35.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/releases\">nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action@v35</h2>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/pull/74\">nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action#74</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Add Nix versions 2.34.7, 2.33.6, 2.32.8</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Remove Nix version 2.26.4</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Update Nix versions: 2.31.2 -&gt; 2.31.5, 2.30.3 -&gt; 2.30.5, 2.29.2\n-&gt; 2.29.4, 2.28.5 -&gt; 2.28.7</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Bump default Nix version: 2.29.2 -&gt; 2.34.7</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Supported Nix Versions on x86_64-linux runners</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>2.34.7</li>\n<li>2.33.6</li>\n<li>2.32.8</li>\n<li>2.31.5</li>\n<li>2.30.5</li>\n<li>2.29.4</li>\n<li>2.28.7</li>\n<li>2.3.18</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Supported Nix Versions on aarch64-linux runners</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>2.34.7</li>\n<li>2.33.6</li>\n<li>2.32.8</li>\n<li>2.31.5</li>\n<li>2.30.5</li>\n<li>2.29.4</li>\n<li>2.28.7</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Supported Nix Versions on x86_64-darwin runners</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>2.34.7</li>\n<li>2.33.6</li>\n<li>2.32.8</li>\n<li>2.31.5</li>\n<li>2.30.5</li>\n<li>2.29.4</li>\n<li>2.28.7</li>\n<li>2.3.18</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/blob/master/RELEASE\">nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action's\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>v35</p>\n<h2>Changes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/pull/74\">nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action#74</a></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Add Nix versions 2.34.7, 2.33.6, 2.32.8</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Remove Nix version 2.26.4</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Update Nix versions: 2.31.2 -&gt; 2.31.5, 2.30.3 -&gt; 2.30.5, 2.29.2\n-&gt; 2.29.4, 2.28.5 -&gt; 2.28.7</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Bump default Nix version: 2.29.2 -&gt; 2.34.7</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/commit/9f63be77f412a248c9d9a65a4c82cf066cdf8f0c\"><code>9f63be7</code></a>\nRelease v35</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/commit/81b361f6cd64bbb933a1bca6e6e3ab945961e4a3\"><code>81b361f</code></a>\nUpdate default Nix version from 2.9.2 to 2.34.7</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/commit/7c013a868622fd5d17c52c862cd8152d9df868bd\"><code>7c013a8</code></a>\nMerge pull request <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/issues/74\">#74</a>\nfrom fornybar/netrc-for-fetchgit</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/commit/2a741a8cc7db7768a8a25d92521c2da7ff1846d2\"><code>2a741a8</code></a>\nAdd Nix 2.32, 2.33 and 2.34</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/commit/599be115537683867e4ac865c4dc91ce8ccffb62\"><code>599be11</code></a>\nUpdate flake.lock</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/commit/36eb8fb90e0eb0c8eeb45c324429e99c91957faf\"><code>36eb8fb</code></a>\nci: Add back x86_64 Mac runner</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/commit/c2987fe8ad08c6a885923719b345c88e50a90cfe\"><code>c2987fe</code></a>\nci: Fix Cachix push</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/commit/18679e51fa43239b49222255dc6a7a96a8855cf1\"><code>18679e5</code></a>\nci: Fix nix.conf check</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/commit/f3a075429dce9133dd837b8d597d9b0f4820c3d3\"><code>f3a0754</code></a>\nci: Bump deps</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/commit/637f587477bcef6b9fcbfbddc8365163f072256a\"><code>637f587</code></a>\nci: Remove macos-13</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action/compare/v34...v35\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility\nscore](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=nixbuild/nix-quick-install-action&package-manager=github_actions&previous-version=34&new-version=35)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>",
