          "message": "fix(odoc): sandbox documentation rules (#15190)\n\nRun odoc and sherlodoc actions under sandboxing and declare hidden .odoc\ndependencies for odoc include directories so linked docs are available\ninside the sandbox.\n\nAdjust legacy HTML/JSON generation to use directory targets for module\noutput, and query odoc for markdown targets instead of assuming a single\noutput file. Update odoc cram expectations for the resulting\ndirectory-target behavior and sandboxed command paths.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
