          "id": "fc8445e214f35daa74907d8f604b7bd7e6cc1512",
          "message": "refactor(nix): extract dev-shell.nix from flake.nix (#15303)\n\nMove `makeDuneDevShell` into its own module under `nix/`. The helper's\nsignature is unchanged; the per-system context (`pkgs`, `INSIDE_NIX`,\n`testBuildInputs`, `testNativeBuildInputs`, `docInputs`, and the source\ndune used by the `duneFromScope` branch) is now passed in as arguments\ninstead of captured from the enclosing `devShells` `let`-block.\n\nHash-stable: the `ox`, `scope`, `default`, and `slim` shells (one per\nbranch of the `pkgs'` selector) produce the same `nix-shell` store paths\nbefore and after.",
