          "id": "ff5dd4b3e988a2c751e1550de6ecd4cb6cf1857c",
          "message": "refactor(nix): drop unused ox-trunk devShell (#15310)\n\n`ox-trunk` is not referenced by any CI workflow, Makefile target, docs\npage, or shell script in the repo. Grepping the tree for `ox-trunk` and\n`nix develop .#ox` confirms zero consumers.\n\nDrop the shell. The `oxcaml-trunk-build` package (which IS used by\n`.github/workflows/revdeps-dev-build.yml`) still pulls in\nmenhir-20231231 via the same `nix/menhir.nix` for now; the next commit\nfolds that into the upstream OxCaml derivation it overrides.",
