          "id": "ea25ca2dd5356f45e5fe2b1b9449f29a68eaf215",
          "message": "refactor(nix): extract OxCaml devShells into nix/devShells/ox.nix (#15312)\n\nMove `bootstrap-ox`, `ox-minimal`, `ox-minimal-trunk`, and `ox` into a\nsingle module under `nix/devShells/`. The module imports\n`nix/oxcaml.nix` internally so `flake.nix` no longer needs to thread\n`oxcaml-setup` through.\n\n`flake.nix` consumes the four shells via:\n\n  inherit (import ./nix/devShells/ox.nix { … })\n    bootstrap-ox ox-minimal ox-minimal-trunk ox;\n\nHash-stable: all four shells produce the same store paths before and\nafter.",
