          "message": "refactor(nix): scope rocq overlays to the rocq devShells (#15314)\n\nThe rocq-core/mkRocqDerivation/rocq-stdlib (and their `-native`\nvariants) overrides lived in the per-system `forAllSystems` overlay and\nso were applied to every shell, even ones with no rocq consumers. Move\nthem into the two shells that actually need them via\n`extraOCamlOverlays`:\n\n- `rocq` shell inlines an overlay that exposes the non-native rocq-core\n/ mkRocqDerivation / rocq-stdlib.\n- `rocq-native` shell inlines a separate, self-contained overlay that\nexposes only the `*-native` variants (computed inline via the `oself`\nfixpoint).\n\nThe two overlays are independent: `rocq-native` no longer pulls in\n`rocqOverlay` just to populate `oself.rocq-core`. The rocq overrides\ndisappear from the global pkgs overlay.\n\nHash-stable: all seven sampled shells (`rocq`, `rocq-native`, `default`,\n`slim`, `ox`, `bootstrap-check`, `scope`) produce the same store paths\nbefore and after.",
