          "id": "b75fa2eb2be6fb20e0eb8e68923d792e0e02d54e",
          "message": "refactor(nix): drop dead mdx override (#15317)\n\n`mdx = osuper.mdx.override { logs = oself.logs; }` was a no-op:\n`overrideScope` already propagates `oself.logs` to `mdx`'s build\nfunction through normal nix evaluation, and the resulting `mdx` store\npath is identical with or without this line (verified against the full\noverlay context).\n\nLikely a historical workaround from when mdx in\nnixpkgs/ocaml-overlays wasn't picking `logs` up correctly from the\nscope.\n\nHash-stable across all sampled devShells.",
