          "message": "refactor(watch): move RPC request goals into build system (#15328)\n\nIntroduce Build_system.Request and Request.Goal, and use them for both\nordinary build commands and watch-mode RPC builds. This keeps the old\nbatching behavior: goals are still evaluated as one combined action\nbuilder and RPC requests are completed only when the build iteration\nfinishes.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
