          "id": "11815c586631c1f8c949f1a41acaa20dc991c7e7",
          "message": "rpc server: cancel long polls when sessions close (#15363)\n\nKeep the active poller table on the Stage1 session so the close\nfinalizer can see pollers even after the upgraded session is shutting\ndown. During close, fire each poller cancel token, and avoid starting a\npoll request if the session is already closing.\n\nThis reuses the in-flight long-poll cancellation path so session\nshutdown wakes blocked long-poll requests and allows the server to\nterminate cleanly.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-28T14:08:39+01:00",
          "tree_id": "dce3fcb412cb0ec6b51b502a5e05bd4587538c79",
