          "id": "795d4255aae331280e3b369f3912031cadd2824a",
          "message": "test(trace): wait for trace init before following nested traces (#15371)\n\nThe trace-cat-follow-nested test intended to wait until the outer dune\nprocess had emitted its config init event before starting dune trace cat\n--follow. The helper always succeeded because the pipeline ended in\nhead, and || true forced success on errors.\n\nUse jq -e so the polling loop actually waits for the init event. Without\nthis synchronization, follow mode can observe only the outer init/exit\npair and miss the nested events the test expects.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
