          "id": "c690c62aec32edb9cb081f5d69ef4b960bf031c4",
          "message": "test(rpc): show idle long-poll state retention (#15415)\n\nAdd an expect test for the memory-retention case where a client closes a\nsession after a long-poll request has completed and the poller is idle.\nThe RPC handler is kept alive, and the state last sent to that session\nremains reachable, showing that session close does not clear idle\nlong-poll state.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
