          "message": "refactor(stdune): distinguish failed process signaling (#15453)\n\nReturn `Dead from Pid.kill when the target disappears before signaling,\nand add Pid.kill_exn for call sites where a missing target should remain\na code error.\n\nUpdate existing callers to use the non-raising result where they\npreviously caught signaling races and Pid.kill_exn elsewhere.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
