          "message": "test(fs_memo): reproduce stale source digest cache (#15490)\n\nAdd a cram test showing that Dune can reuse a stale cached source digest\nwhen a\nsource file changes while preserving the stat fields tracked by the\npersistent\ndigest database. Removing _build drops the stale digest and rule caches,\nand the\nsame build then sees the changed source.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
