          "id": "2140bd7e3b3b40845281e0c37d9bf320b476bf14",
          "message": "fix(fsevents): initialize events before allocation (#15525)\n\nThe FSEvents callback allocated an event block before boxing its\nidentifier and flags. Either boxing operation can trigger a collection\nthat scans the event block while its fields still contain garbage.\n\nBox and root both values before allocating and initializing the event\nblock.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
