          "id": "2c1d4007c9f60aaeccc0c3e67f7dd1c4334439fa",
          "message": "fix(stdune): reject oversized copyfile paths (#15527)\n\nThe macOS copyfile stub copies OCaml paths into PATH_MAX-sized stack\nbuffers. caml_unix_check_path rejects embedded NUL bytes but does not\nenforce a length limit, so an oversized path could overflow those\nbuffers.\n\nKeep the lengths as mlsize_t and raise ENAMETOOLONG before copying any\npath that cannot fit with its terminating NUL.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-18T12:30:04+08:00",
          "tree_id": "bead104ae0a139c4665503cc21b1fa3804adf1ee",
