          "id": "2491ab83776613472759a492c4dc037d1f74e0e1",
          "message": "fix(stdune): initialize wait4 results before allocation (#15524)\n\nOCaml blocks contain uninitialized fields until the C stub fills them.\nThe wait4 stub allocated its result tuple and then allocated the boxed\nprocess status, allowing a collection to scan the remaining garbage\nfields.\n\nAllocate and root the process status first, then construct the result\ntuple without any intervening allocation.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
