          "message": "fix(rpc): allow pthread chdir to raise (#15523)\n\nThe macOS pthread chdir stub reports syscall failures with uerror, which\nallocates and raises an OCaml exception. Marking the external noalloc\nlets native code omit the bookkeeping required for both operations.\n\nRemove the annotation so failures can safely propagate to OCaml.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
