          "id": "1d50b3b26cbead3a2cf61530465b44c6cc8fb3b4",
          "message": "ci: fix Mirage workflow with setup-ocaml 3.7 (#15572)\n\nRecent `setup-ocaml@v3` releases pin local packages with `file://` URLs.\nIn the Mirage workflow this makes `caldav` an rsync source inside the\ncheckout, so `opam-monorepo pull` tries to vendor the repository into\nits own `mirage/duniverse/caldav` subdirectory and rejects the\noverlapping paths.\n\nDisable automatic local pinning and explicitly pin the tested caldav\nrevision from Git instead.\n\nValidated end-to-end on the fork:\nhttps://github.com/Alizter/dune/actions/runs/29736052437",
