          "message": "test(completion): exercise shell backends (#15596)\n\n## Summary\n\n- add end-to-end Zsh and PowerShell completion tests\n- guard shell-specific tests on executable availability and run\nPowerShell under `runtest-windows`\n- include Fish in supported Nix dev shells so its hand-maintained\nbackend is exercised in CI\n- track `%{bin:git}` when generating the git-daemon location so changing\nGit installations invalidates the cached path\n\n## Testing\n\n- `./dune.exe build @check @fmt`\n- `./dune.exe build @test/blackbox-tests/test-cases/completion/runtest\n@test/blackbox-tests/test-cases/completion/runtest-windows`\n- `./dune.exe build\n@test/expect-tests/dune_pkg/rev_store_fetch_depth/runtest`",
