          "message": "test(pkg): dependency cycles are tolerated or crash (#15619)\n\n## Description\n\nAdd regression coverage for dependency cycles reachable from local\npackages:\n\n- A hand-written cycle between lock-directory packages is silently\naccepted by validation.\n- A cycle between workspace packages is accepted by validation, then\ncrashes `dune describe pkg list-locked-dependencies --transitive` with\nan internal error.\n\nThis captures the current behavior before the combined dependency-graph\ntraversal and user-facing cycle diagnostics are introduced.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nPart of #8652.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests added, if applicable.\n- [x] Change log entry not applicable; this is a test-only change.\n- [x] Documentation not applicable; this is a test-only change.",
