          "message": "fix(rpc): rescan registry after mtime changes (#15634)\n\n## Description\n\nSkip RPC registry scans only when the directory mtime is unchanged, and\nrecord each newly observed mtime. This allows clients that poll before\nDune registers to discover the new registry entry while avoiding\nrepeated scans afterward.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nFixes #15630. The regression test was added in #15632.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests added in #15632.\n- [x] Change log entry added.\n- [x] Documentation is not applicable to this bug fix.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
