          "id": "18e7fa23353d869c4449dcd59a0ae342f3ae3b4e",
          "message": "refactor(engine): compact fs memo directory contents (#15658)\n\nRepresent cached directory contents with separate filename sets for\nregular files and directories, retaining a map only for uncommon file\nkinds. This avoids storing the common file kind alongside every entry.\n\nCallers that construct sorted sets and maps now establish their own\nordering, and the workspace cache version is bumped for the\npersistent-format change.\n\nFollow-up to #15655.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
