          "id": "0cc0be90e21f53fbbbcf610ca5d48ef44d3b89dd",
          "message": "perf(engine): fuse short action builder chains (#15702)\n\nAction builders can retain chains of adjacent `Map` or `Bind` nodes\nuntil rule evaluation. Represent runs of up to three operations with one\nGADT constructor and evaluate them without the intermediate builder\nnodes and evaluator continuations. The public API and evaluation order\nare unchanged.\n\nOn a warmed no-op `@install` self-build, three allocation profiles\nshowed about 0.2M fewer promoted words and 0.2M fewer live words.\nInstruction-only Cachegrind measured a 0.7% reduction; native wall time\nremained neutral.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
