          "id": "f099c0676367d18b28004378d3254bd9567506f2",
          "message": "perf(engine): fuse mixed action builder chains (#15704)\n\nFollowing #15702, collapse the two remaining two-node mixed chains—`Map`\nover `Bind` and `Bind` over `Map`—into dedicated GADT constructors. This\nremoves one persistent builder node and evaluator continuation while\npreserving evaluation and dependency order.\n\nOn a warmed no-op `@install` self-build, three allocation profiles\nshowed about 0.2M fewer promoted words. Instruction-only Cachegrind\nmeasured a further 0.2% reduction; native wall time remained neutral.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
