          "distinct": true,
          "id": "60c5e4a88063804579874e4c6ec992df78499ffd",
          "message": "perf(engine): fuse discarded action builder results (#15711)\n\nRepresent `a >>> b` directly as an action-builder node instead of\nconstructing a `Both` node followed by `Map snd`. Evaluation remains\napplicative: both builders still run through `Memo.fork_and_join`, and\ntheir dependencies are combined in the same order.\n\nThis removes an intermediate node from a common rule-construction path.\nAcross no-op self-build targets it reduced promoted allocation by\n0.08M–0.12M words and live allocation by 0.03M–0.05M words; alternating\n`@check` runs improved median wall time by 0.6%.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
