          "id": "aea426f758c8fe8d50df5896b3a180fb03e6c74a",
          "message": "refactor: compact produced-target maps (#15713)\n\nStore immutable produced-target directory entries in sorted array maps\ninstead of tree maps, retaining the tree representation only while\nconstructing them. Extend the compact map API with the traversal\noperations needed by produced targets and update the build-system call\nsites accordingly.\n\nBecause produced targets are part of the serialized workspace cache\nrepresentation, bump its format version to invalidate existing entries\nsafely.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
