          "id": "83b06054f6ec568842ce6314269a19910643876f",
          "message": "test(fiber): expand scheduler behavior coverage (#15743)\n\nFiber's tests currently exercise several scheduler invariants only\nindirectly. Add focused regression coverage for:\n\n- delayed and reusable computations, fused map ordering, and exception\npropagation;\n- preserved user backtraces and parallel-map input ordering;\n- pending, running, completed, and failing lazy fibers;\n- mutex exclusion and error cleanup, plus multiple Svar waiters and\ntheir fiber-local contexts;\n- worker and combiner failures in every map-reduce variant.\n\nThese tests capture existing public behavior and are independent of the\nscheduler's internal representation. They are split from #15723 so the\ncoverage can land independently.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
