          "id": "d4012934b69d8e5dff40ac4b8f6053d16de55754",
          "message": "Fix command-from-user-path to avoid shadowing (#15712)\n\n## Description\n\nIf a dev had a program called `hello` on their path that emitted\ndifferent output, then this test would fail, since the path to the bin\nwas _suffixed_ to the `PATH`.\n\nThis was affecting me due to an a long forgotten install of `hello` thru\na nix tutorial.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests added, if applicable.\n- [x] [Change log entry\nadded](../CONTRIBUTING.md#updating-the-changelog) for any user-facing\nchanges.\n- [x] Documentation added for any user-facing changes.",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-11T15:54:04-04:00",
          "tree_id": "520b0b4cd2b629c4284c9a961e572fa5e3462724",
