          "message": "refactor(stdune): use Fd.t in Spawn (#15771)\n\nReplace raw `Unix.file_descr` values exposed by `Spawn` with `Fd.t`,\nincluding standard streams, working directories, and `safe_pipe`\nresults. Make `Working_dir.t` abstract, keep raw descriptors confined to\nthe foreign-function boundary, and update callers to use the managed\ndescriptor API.\n\nThis removes unnecessary unsafe conversions from callers and gives\nspawned-process descriptors consistent close tracking.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
