          "message": "Dune tool management requirements (#13457)\n\nThis proposes a set of high level, functional requirements for our\ntooling management functionality.\n\nFixes #15545\n\nThe requirements proposed here are informed by our experience with the\ncurrent prototype, our use of other successful tools addressing this\nproblem space, and by recent design discussions.\n\n- [x] This should be informed by (and make reference to) existing\nsuccessful package management tools (uv, cargo, etc.)\n- [x] This should be informed by what we have learned from the\nshortcoming of the current implementation",
