          "message": "fix(merlin): expose dependency annotation paths for private library modules (#15977)\n\nExpose dependency object directories to Merlin as annotation-only CMT\npaths. CMT paths have no bearing on auto-completion, but will still\nallow locate to work.\n\nFixes #4892. Follows #15972.\n\n\nThis is an alternative to these:\n\n- https://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/4905\n- https://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/6405\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonio Nuno Monteiro <anmonteiro@gmail.com>",
