          "id": "c4a706d667dd9c906f99a814967ba7bc05df2fed",
          "message": "fix(stdune): tolerate macOS process group EPERM (#16059)\n\nOn macOS, `kill(2)` may return `EPERM` when any member of a process\ngroup cannot be signaled. Treat that result as delivered for group\nsignals so canceling a build does not crash the Dune server.\n\nFixes #16053\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
