          "message": "test(watch): reproduce staleness after queue overflow (#16060)\n\nAdd a private RPC command that injects the file-watcher queue-overflow\npath and waits for the resulting rebuild. A blackbox test uses it to\nreproduce the stale glob behavior without requiring macOS or exhausting\nthe operating system's event queue.\n\nThis intentionally captures the current broken behavior; a follow-up\nchange will update the expectation alongside the fix.\n\nRelated to #16052.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
