          "id": "82ff37ecc57c270ae371cdd001118c5d141131c4",
          "message": "perf(targets): avoid intermediate validation states (#16078)\n\nTarget validation currently folds through `Validation_result.t`,\nrebuilding both the validated-target record and its `Valid` wrapper for\nevery target.\n\nChoose the common root once, accumulate file and directory basename sets\ndirectly, and construct the validation result only after successful\ntraversal. Validation order and error precedence remain unchanged, while\nthe common successful path performs fewer allocations.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
