          "id": "2789db8a16f948dcb2865b9929dced0bddbbe5c1",
          "message": "perf: batch qualified module dependency lookup (#15752)\n\nPrepare qualified-module dependency lookup once per batch so parent\ndiscovery is not repeated for every dependency name.\n\nBuilds on #15724; behavior is covered by #15754, #15759, and #15823.\nDependency-closure caching is deferred to separate work.\n\nBenchmarks against `6cfbe56ed6` (medians from three alternating 3-second\nrounds):\n\n| Case | Base | Batched | Speedup |\n|---|---:|---:|---:|\n| Empty deep-parent batch | 3.78ns | 2.82ns | 1.34x |\n| Reused deep-parent batch | 56.13us | 10.91us | 5.15x |\n| Reused qualified-group batch | 25.92us | 14.30us | 1.81x |\n| Qualified-group batch, including setup | 490.04us | 454.16us | 1.08x |\n| Depth-512 self-only batch | 472.89ns | 456.97ns | 1.03x |\n| Single depth-128 group control | 26.50us | 26.24us | 1.01x |\n\nThe deep-parent case reduces minor/major allocation by 94.37%/93.67%;\nthe qualified-group case reduces them by 44.61%/40.72%.\n\nThe benchmark harness is not included in this PR.\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonio Nuno Monteiro <anmonteiro@gmail.com>",
