          "message": "refactor(lang): type module artifact filenames (#16104)\n\n`Module_name.Unique.artifact_filename` always produces a single path\ncomponent, but returned it as an unstructured string. Return\n`Filename.t` so this invariant is represented in the type and use\nfilename-aware path construction at call sites.\n\nThis avoids sending known filenames through general path parsing and\nnormalization without changing generated artifact paths.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
