          "id": "a06a520ae1b6ad0474d57de62d6735e4116beaf8",
          "message": "test(cache): reproduce absolute build directory miss (#16106)\n\n## Description\n\nAdd a dedicated cram test for the shared-cache miss that occurs when the\nsame build directory is first spelled relatively and then absolutely.\nThe test inspects Dune's cache trace directly and records the\nshared-cache `miss`, avoiding action-output and undeclared-target\nsentinels.\n\nThis test-only change precedes the fix so the behavior change remains\nreviewable separately.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nRegression coverage for #16072.",
