          "message": "test(blake3): add property tests (#16110)\n\nAdd property tests for the compact BLAKE3 digest representation\nintroduced in #16100. Generated 128-bit values exercise serialization,\nequality, lexicographic ordering, and the common-prefix hash behavior.\n\nThe test library remains optional for environments without\n`ppx_quick_test`. Standard Nix CI installs the compatible v0.17 package;\nthe OxCaml shell excludes its incompatible v0.18 preview.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
