          "id": "057d98b39d7e2e6a68e34b2878ae4194b80bf560",
          "message": "refactor(rules): share executable pps resolution (#16132)\n\nExecutable compilation, installation, artifact loading, and utop\ngeneration independently applied instrumentation and collected the\nresulting PPX dependencies before resolving libraries.\n\nCentralize that logic in `Lib.DB`. The helper operates on preprocessing\nconfiguration and reuses the database's existing instrumentation\nresolver, avoiding a dependency from the library database onto\nexecutable stanzas.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
