          "id": "f508f7ed73b91db1dd790b5bb0244850ad15a6f6",
          "message": "refactor(memo): add Option.value (#16145)\n\nSeveral memoized rule paths repeat the same operation: return an\noptional value when present, otherwise lazily compute a monadic default.\n\nAdd `Option.value` to the monad interface and use it across executable\nconfiguration, environment lookup, JavaScript and Rocq rules, and\nsubsystem selection. The default remains a thunk, so existing\nshort-circuiting behavior is preserved.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
