          "id": "f35beffe3bad6f61ead2bac533b2327b5f67be2f",
          "message": "test(pkg): cover explicit lock platform precedence (#16169)\n\n## Description\n\nAdd focused coverage for the precedence between explicit\n`solve_for_platforms` entries and conflicting platform variables\ninherited from a lock stanza's `solver_env`.\n\nThe test verifies that each explicit platform remains authoritative:\nLinux and macOS lock packages retain the package fields selected for\ntheir requested platform rather than being overwritten by the\nstanza-wide solver environment.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nThis behavior is independent of the build-context solver-environment bug\nand should remain covered separately before the multi-platform solver\nchanges.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests added.\n- [ ] Change log entry added, if required.\n- [ ] Documentation added, if required.",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-24T14:07:09+02:00",
