          "message": "test: reproduce stale private module interface rebuild (#16174)\n\n## Description\n\nAdd a blackbox test reproducing the stale consumer artifact from #16071.\nAfter a private module interface changes, the consumer's `.cmx` is not\nrebuilt and native linking fails with inconsistent interface\nassumptions.\n\nThis is a reproduction-only change; the fix will follow separately.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nReproduces #16071.",
