          "id": "458b7e38cbfa498910a09aeaf1c9db29437b1caa",
          "message": "test(ppx): demonstrate unsandboxed lint action (#16175)\n\nAdd a lint regression case whose PPX behavior depends on whether an\nundeclared generated target is visible.\n\nThe test records the current target visibility during linting,\ndemonstrating that lint PPX execution is not sandboxed. This is the\ntest-only precursor to sandboxing lint actions in a follow-up change.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
