          "message": "fix(stdune): preserve malformed ANSI escape text (#16116)\n\nMalformed or incomplete ANSI sequences currently cause Dune's color\nhandling to discard subsequent text. The stripper also fails to\nterminate erase-line sequences at `K`, so ordinary output can disappear\nuntil a later style sequence.\n\nRecognize complete style and erase-line controls with a shared scanner\nwhile preserving unrecognized text. Escape-free strings are returned\nunchanged, keeping the common path allocation-free.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
