          "id": "bf81328019c37f94ba048036aab8355cce3950e3",
          "message": "fix(cram): stop truncating test names (#16146)\n\nPreserve the full `.t` basename when deriving cram test names starting\nwith Dune language 3.25, while retaining historical suffix-less names\nfor older projects.\n\nUse the project language version consistently for generated aliases,\n`applies_to`, and direct `dune test` requests. Update boundary coverage\nand migrate the repository cram stanzas and reference documentation to\nthe 3.25 naming convention.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
