          "message": "fix(action-plugin): handle empty glob directories (#16207)\n\n`read_directory_with_glob` currently fails when its directory is absent,\nincluding when Dune does not materialize a generated directory whose\nglob has no matches. Treat `ENOENT` and `ENOTDIR` from opening the\ndirectory as an empty listing, consistently for direct and dynamic\nexecution.\n\nFixes #4445\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
