          "id": "d23bcf08ec190128c6b916fead2d322afed4fea2",
          "message": "test: reproduce predicated findlib tool crash (#16236)\n\n## Description\n\nReproduction case for #16226.\n\nAdd a minimal cram test for a Findlib tool defined only under a\ntoolchain\npredicate. When Dune initializes the default context, the unmatched tool\nvalue\nis interpreted as an empty string and currently causes an internal\nerror.\n\nA fix will follow in a separate PR.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\n#16226 reports a regression when `OCAMLFIND_CONF` supplies the Solo5\ntoolchain\nthrough a `findlib.conf.d` snippet. The test reduces that configuration\nto the\npredicated `ocamlmklib` entry which triggers the crash.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `dune build @check @fmt`\n- `dune runtest test/blackbox-tests/test-cases/custom-cross-compilation`",
