          "message": "refactor: rename dune_targets to targets (#16242)\n\nThe target representation is consumed as `Targets` throughout the\nengine, cache, rules, and CLI, but each component currently aliases\n`Dune_targets`.\n\nName the internal library and its main module `Targets` directly, remove\nthe aliases, and update the bootstrap module roots and library\ndependencies to match.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
