          "message": "fix(engine): retain action builder memo names (#16246)\n\n`Action_builder.memoize` accepts a caller-provided name but currently\ndiscards it\nin favor of generic labels shared by every action builder.\n\nRetain the supplied name and append phase-specific suffixes, restoring\nuseful\nidentities in memo diagnostics while keeping lazy and eager evaluations\ndistinct.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
