          "message": "test(engine): cover concurrent process redirections (#16254)\n\nAdd a regression demonstrating that concurrent process actions beneath\none\nstdout redirection share and close a single-use `Process.Io` value. One\nchild's\noutput reaches the target while the other escapes to Dune's own output.\n\nThis intentionally records the current faulty behavior so a follow-up\nfix can\nupdate the snapshot.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
