          "id": "0348d707763359975f04fda89e22ef8b48e8ff0a",
          "message": "fix(engine): share concurrent action redirections safely (#16257)\n\nConcurrent children inherited the same single-use `Process.Io` values.\nThe\nfirst process spawn could close a redirected descriptor before its\nsiblings\nused it, causing their output to escape the redirection.\n\nGive each child a multi-use view while leaving ownership with the\nenclosing\naction. The regression added in #16254 now records both lines in the\ntarget and\nno escaped output.",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-29T22:46:19+01:00",
          "tree_id": "35fa15a51408a9738638572dc8b42aa54a9faf92",
