          "message": "test(rpc): expose server-relative request paths (#16258)\n\nAdd regression coverage for relative commands forwarded to a running\nwatch server. The test starts the server from one workspace subdirectory\nand invokes build, exec, and runtest from another, recording that\nrequests currently resolve from the server's startup directory.\n\nThis provides test-first coverage for a follow-up fix that will make\nforwarded paths relative to the client invocation.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
