          "id": "38eb20ad61c484b7f4b023d8f6e12d36ecd663e1",
          "message": "fix(opam): restore promotion after generated file deletion (#16234)\n\n## Description\n\nRun generated OPAM-file diff actions in a sandbox. After a generated\nOPAM file\nis deleted, the stale build-tree copy is no longer a declared dependency\nand is\ntherefore excluded from the sandbox. The diff then treats the source as\nmissing\nand records a creation promotion.\n\nThe regression test was added separately in #16232. This PR updates its\nexpectations to cover the fix.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nFixes #16233\n\nDeleting a generated OPAM file should allow `@opam` to regenerate and\npromote\nit again.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `dune build @check @fmt`\n- `dune runtest test/blackbox-tests/test-cases/dune-project-meta`",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-31T12:34:17+02:00",
          "tree_id": "6b9b2167b1c84f44b3cc76db47182b6e38d26a81",
