          "id": "af85a39e1341b9382dabc3d892fac467c9aa716e",
          "message": "test(sat): expose non-chronological backtracking (#16281)\n\n## Summary\n\nExpose the current SAT decision level to custom deciders and add an\nexpect test demonstrating that a non-chronological backjump is\nobservable as a decrease between decider calls.\n\nThe test constructs a conflict involving decisions at levels 1 and 3,\nwith an unrelated decision at level 2, and verifies that conflict\nanalysis returns the decider from level 2 to level 1. This establishes\nthe invalidation signal used by incremental deciders such as the\npackage-solver optimization in #16217.\n\nThis change was split from #16217 so the SAT callback contract can be\nreviewed independently of the performance changes.\n\n## Testing\n\n- SAT expect test covering the non-chronological backjump\n- The same change previously passed the full CI matrix as the first\ncommit of #16217",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-31T13:13:20+02:00",
