          "id": "75c681fe653df176d7ae08e61a3eb4d8bc9fc68b",
          "message": "fix: conditional on XCode 15 compat for c++ flags (#16275)\n\n## Description\n\nXCode 15 is not limited to M chips, but is now standard, and any dev\nworking on Mac stuff needs XCode 15 or better since April if they want\nto publish in the mac ecosystem (see\nhttps://developer.apple.com/news/upcoming-requirements/).\n\nThis fix resolves another specious test failure on my old intel macbook.\n\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nAlso part of trying go get a clean build for\nhttps://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/15642",
