          "id": "16df7179df0aba5d33d1e13c7a7e51bf10023643",
          "message": "refactor(stdune): move Dune_sexp under Stdune (#16288)\n\n`Dune_sexp` only depends on `stdune`; make it part of `Stdune` so Stdune\ncode can use it without introducing a dependency cycle.\n\nExpose it as `Stdune.Dune_sexp` and use qualified subdirectories to\npreserve its module structure. Update bootstrap metadata and consumers,\nand move its inline escape expectations to the existing test library so\npublic `stdune` does not gain PPX runtime dependencies.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-03T16:05:10+01:00",
