          "id": "343f7c3eb31d3181706f370adc55615f1470fab3",
          "message": "refactor(glob): merge package into action plugin (#16328)\n\n`dune-glob` is used by Dune internals and exposed through the\naction-plugin API, so the separate package boundary adds unnecessary\npackaging and dependency machinery.\n\nMove the glob implementation and tests into `dune-action-plugin`, expose\nit as `Dune_action_plugin.V1.Glob`, update internal consumers, and\nremove the standalone `dune-glob` package.\n\nThis is preparatory work for #16256.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-04T19:26:03+01:00",
