          "message": "refactor(action-plugin): remove target writing API (#16329)\n\nThe action plugin maintains and validates a second set of targets even\nthough dynamic actions can produce outputs through ordinary process I/O\nand Dune already owns rule target validation. This duplicates\nresponsibility and unnecessarily prevents dynamic actions from being\nused in rules with directory targets.\n\nRemove `write_file` from the plugin API, stop transporting and\nvalidating target sets, and adapt examples and tests to use stdout\nredirection where appropriate. Dynamic actions are now allowed in rules\nwith directory targets.\n\nThis prepares the action-plugin RPC work in #16256.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
