          "message": "test(package-deps): reproduce untracked installed libraries (#16346)\n\nAdds focused regression coverage for `(deps (package a))` with an\ninstalled library requirement `a -> b`. Related to #15511.\n\n- Exercise both `dune-package` and META readers with independent\nconsumers.\n- Keep masked workspace fallback in its own fixture, checking\nworkspace-root precedence and installed-dependency fallback through both\nreaders.\n- Show labelled interface, archive, metadata, and unrelated-sibling\ndependency observations.\n- Demonstrate stale bytecode output after replacing only the installed\n`b.cma`, without changing the requested package or cleaning the\nconsumer.\n\nThe expectations intentionally record missing required dependencies and\nthe stale result (`2` instead of `11`), so this test-only PR passes\nbefore the implementation fix. Applying the follow-up fix was verified\nto change only the required dependency observations and stale results;\nexclusions and stability checks remain unchanged.\n\nIncludes the five-line file-or-selector query helper also used by\n#16345. It contains no other provider test changes or implementation\nfixes, and needs no user-facing documentation or changelog entry.\n\nValidation: `@check @fmt`, `installed-package.t`, and\n`installed-only-packages-fallback.t` passed independently on this\npre-fix change.",
