          "message": "test(action-plugin): expose ignored stdout redirection (#16355)\n\nInspect the redirected target in the existing action-plugin copy test.\nIts combined terminal output currently looks correct even though the\nplugin writes to Dune’s stdout and leaves the target empty.\n\nThis records the current broken behavior without changing the\nimplementation; the stdout-forwarding fix can follow separately.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
