          "id": "ce400572cdee2c872ba54c52567ce2c629409ce0",
          "message": "fix(cache): make metadata read-only (#16393)\n\nShared-cache metadata is immutable, but its files were left writable.\nMake newly written metadata read-only in both cache storage modes,\nwithout changing the atomic writer API.\n\nOn Windows, restore the read-only attribute after temporary hardlink\ncleanup, which can clear it on the published cache entry. Existing\nmetadata files are left unchanged.",
