          "id": "3eca42e43ac95b65ca66fb76b626831ed29cf717",
          "message": "feat(action-plugin): expose explicit dependency batches (#16394)\n\nExpose `Action_plugin.build_deps` in the core and Lwt APIs for batches\nof file, directory, and glob dependencies. Plugins can wait for these\ndependencies and then use ordinary I/O or pass them to another program,\nwithout reading their contents through the plugin API.\n\nPaths use the current directory when the call starts, and duplicate\ndependencies are removed within each batch. Existing read helpers and\nthe RPC protocol are unchanged. Tests cover subprocess consumption,\nmixed batches, glob filtering, and changing cwd while a request is\npending.\n\nRelated to #5681.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-13T14:16:56+01:00",
