          "id": "75e482e4ae23d91384ca0ef8ed5ccf36095e9cce",
          "message": "test(action-plugin): cover accepted exit codes (#16399)\n\nAdd a plugin mode that exits with a requested status after DAP\ninitialization. The test first checks the default zero/nonzero exit\npolicy, then exercises explicitly accepted and rejected statuses in\nseparate rules.\n\nThe expectations record the current parser rejection of `dynamic-run`\ninside `with-accepted-exit-codes`. This is test-only; enabling the\nmodifier and updating the expectations are left to the implementation\nchange.\n\nRelated to #5681.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
