          "id": "e8d3e7c0ab55422d8eeeddd904cb142896d6d8f4",
          "message": "feat(action-plugin): honor accepted exit codes (#16402)\n\nAllow `dynamic-run` under `with-accepted-exit-codes`, including the\nsupported nested action modifiers. Apply the enclosing exit-code policy\ninstead of always requiring zero.\n\nThe executable must still initialize its Action Plugin session: an\naccepted status does not make an ordinary executable a valid plugin.\nUpdate the regression expectations from #16399 and retain checks for\nuninitialized executables.\n\nRelated to #5681.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
