          "id": "922c3b75ea3e618fc8176d9629674eefea989fcf",
          "message": "feat(action-plugin): allow multiple dynamic invocations (#16403)\n\nRemove the single-invocation restriction so a rule can combine\n`dynamic-run` actions sequentially with `progn` or in parallel with\n`concurrent`. Invocations retain their working directories, and changes\nto either discovered input invalidate the enclosing rule.\n\nUpdate the regression expectations from #16400 to cover successful\ncomposition and dependency invalidation.\n\nRelated to #5681.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
