          "id": "34e632ca1b78c399e350b1ac7f77e7c0895c887f",
          "message": "refactor(action-plugin): make the Lwt runner non-exiting (#16404)\n\nMake `Dune_rpc_lwt.V1.Action_plugin.run` return `unit Lwt.t` rather than\ndriving the event loop or exiting the process. This lets plugin\nexecution compose with other Lwt computations and leaves error reporting\nand process lifetime to the caller.\n\nUpdate executables and examples to use `Lwt_main.run (run action)`, and\ndocument the breaking API change.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
