          "id": "1ded9f6922c9b384767d719d8620592f5ea11b71",
          "message": "test(action-plugin): drain requests after Lwt cancellation (#16405)\n\nExercise cancellation of an in-flight action-plugin dependency read\nafter Dune has accepted the request. The generator waits for the plugin\nto exit, ensuring the request remains outstanding when the client calls\n`Lwt.cancel`.\n\nCheck that accepted work finishes before sandbox destruction and that\nits dependencies still invalidate the cached action. This is test-only\ncoverage of the existing draining behavior.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
