          "id": "44bb145a87b1867a7f42a015fb6e8046e2061b5d",
          "message": "test(action-plugin): expose cached fallback after a caught dependency error (#16407)\n\nAdd a regression where a plugin catches a failed required-dependency\nrequest, writes a fallback, and exits successfully. Dune currently\ncaches that result and keeps returning the fallback after the missing\ninput is created. A fresh-build control reads the newly available input.\n\nThe expectations record the current behavior. This PR contains only the\ntest and its helper, not the server-side fix that retains failed\ndependency requests.\n\nRelated to #5681.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
