          "id": "99dac374ef5ce2acceb5da60898e4a73a5cf4b5b",
          "message": "test(cache): expose metadata read errors reported as missing (#16408)\n\nAdd cram coverage for loading missing metadata and an existing directory\nvia `dune internal cache-metadata`. Both currently report \"cache\nmetadata not found\": the directory case exposes that text-mode IO errors\nare incorrectly classified as missing entries.\n\nThis is a passing, test-only reproduction of the current bug. The fix is\nkept separate.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
