          "id": "7017e7c6b647740d2421875c111a0da9b8356161",
          "message": "test(watch): avoid counting eager exec server status messages (#16435)\n\nThe initial eager build can overlap the build forwarded by `dune exec`,\nso expecting exactly two watch success messages makes\n`watching-eager-concurrent-exec-command.t` flaky.\n\nCapture the background server output separately and check for a\nsuccessful build after shutdown, without depending on the number of\nstatus messages. All existing `dune exec` assertions remain unchanged.\n\nThe watching suite and build/format checks pass. The earlier full-suite\nrun encountered unrelated bubblewrap permission and stdune IO failures.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
