          "id": "3d85a095574a950948ae7d980d97bb1dd24b56e3",
          "message": "fix(action-plugin): retain failures and reject further requests (#16439)\n\nRemember required-dependency failures for the lifetime of a dynamic\naction, so a plugin cannot turn them into a cacheable success by\ncatching the RPC error.\n\nOnce a failure is recorded, reject subsequent dependency requests for\nthat action without starting further builds. Requests already accepted\nstill drain before the action finishes. The RPC type is unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
