          "message": "test(action-plugin): expose stale outputs during watch rebuilds (#16444)\n\nRecord a dynamic action that restarts after cancellation, but whose\noutput remains at `ready` after a subsequent input change despite\nanother successful watch build. A fresh build produces the updated\nvalue, `again`.\n\nThis PR contains only a cram regression recording current behavior; the\ndependency-propagation fix is separate.\n\nRelated to #5681.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
