          "id": "05a869db873ceef309a046ef593a27a89777b4be",
          "message": "refactor(engine): hide alias expansion ordering (#16527)\n\nMake `Rules.Dir_rules.Alias_spec` abstract, exposing singleton\nconstruction and list conversion instead of its `Appendable_list`\nrepresentation. Keep the reversal inside `Alias_spec` so `Load_rules` no\nlonger needs to know how expansions accumulate. Existing expansion order\nand behavior are preserved.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
