          "id": "47c91f75be29b731e592aa1387e2494bd2903484",
          "message": "fix: remove expansion limitation (#10160)\n\nPreviously, we'd limit the variables that we could expand in the install\r\nstanzas. This limitation was needed before we had memo and cycle\r\ndetection. Now that we have those, we can just rely on those mechanisms\r\nand let users expand whatever they want.\r\n\r\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2024-03-01T15:00:30Z",
          "tree_id": "74ef81af70adbfa323f8311564490ae737437e5f",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/47c91f75be29b731e592aa1387e2494bd2903484"
