          "message": "chore: Fix wasm_of_ocaml in CI (#11507)\n\n* chore: Fix wasm_of_ocaml in CI\n\nIt doesn't need to be pinned anymore and the current development version\nfails. Better use a released version for stability.\n\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>\n\n* Simplify binaryen setup\n\nSuggestion by @hhugo from the jsoo/wasmoo repo Github actions.\n\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>\n\n* Drop Ninja\n\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>",
