          "message": "pkg: support for dependencies compressed with zip (#11511)\n\n* pkg: support for dependencies compressed with zip\n\nPreviously dune assumed that all package source archives are tarballs,\npossibly compressed with gzip. This change adds supports for zip files\nwhich comprise a small number of packages in the opam repository.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>\n\n* pkg: fall back to tar and bsdtar for zip files\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
