          "id": "3d196f3faa2b6ef68fabc401e5b2e6f98456e744",
          "message": "pkg: set arch variable when solving portable lockdir (#11927)\n\nWithout the `arch` variable set to a known architecture the\n`ocaml-compiler` package only installs the bytecode compiler. This\nchange sets `arch` to `x86_64` and `arm64` in the default solver\nenvironments.\n\nSigned-off-by: Stephen Sherratt <stephen@sherra.tt>",
          "timestamp": "2025-06-19T13:10:38+02:00",
          "tree_id": "e8651e8bb1346f6dbda2c8d4f0c92463f4b96132",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/3d196f3faa2b6ef68fabc401e5b2e6f98456e744"
