          "id": "9614f40cb397f49490ea122edaf88aa3010253df",
          "message": "refactor: optimize reading files (#11975)\n\nUsing channels to read a file into a string is rather slow and creates a\nmutex + a bunch of useless intermediate buffers.\n\nWe instead initialize the buffer once before reading.\n\nThis optimization has been used internally for ages with great success.\nThis is an attempt to make a portable version of it.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
