          "id": "377d071144113447076843dc00bf1633b813d2e1",
          "message": "Publish Dune Docker images during release (#12252)\n\n* Add a GitHub action workflow for pushing docker images for every release\n\nSigned-off-by: Sudha Parimala <sudharg247@gmail.com>\n\n* update from reviews\n\nSigned-off-by: Sudha Parimala <sudharg247@gmail.com>\n\n* enable manual trigger for docker-image GitHub Actions workflow\n\nSigned-off-by: Sudha Parimala <sudharg247@gmail.com>\n\n* Don't install curl in the build image\n\nSigned-off-by: Shon Feder <shon.feder@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Sudha Parimala <sudharg247@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Shon Feder <shon.feder@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Shon Feder <shon.feder@gmail.com>",
