          "id": "31b9feabc797cb53243e5aa09d5e9bf1b2240191",
          "message": "pkg: improve performance of null builds (#12248) (#12517)\n\nBetween now and the investigation of this slowness described in the issue, I have\nforgotten what's happening exactly, but regardless this Pkg_rules.DB.t type is large,\nwhich makes comparing it with itself costly. By avoiding recomputing the same\ndatastructure multiple times, we can cutoff the comparison with physical equality.\n\n`dune build -j 1` in the test repo from the issue goes from 4s to 2s or so.\n\nSigned-off-by: Valentin Gatien-Baron <valentin.gatienbaron@gmail.com>",
