          "id": "d9d844e1325e1aab6a014745c5f8c1a209f3cf83",
          "message": "ci: enforce unique prefix when restoring cache (#13091)\n\nBy using a double dash `--` we can explicitly mark the prefix part of\nthe cache key, avoiding wrong restores.\n\nThis had caused unrelated jobs to use eachother's cache which meant they\nhad to fallback to the secondary cache from nix overlays. That's fine,\nbut we should only do that when we don't have our main cache available.\n\ntldr; stop `nix-build-` prefix matching on `nix-build-ox-` by ending\nprefix with `--`.",
          "timestamp": "2025-12-29T13:03:56Z",
          "tree_id": "a187bc2df0c73dc242feaf96cb5871eb7953053c",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/d9d844e1325e1aab6a014745c5f8c1a209f3cf83"
