          "id": "7eb65428289e7e45830faf128151e8867f020364",
          "message": "dune_trace: csexp (#13059)\n\nSwitch to csexp instead of json. A few reasons for this:\n\n1. We actually have a csexp parser in dune so we can read these events\nin dune\n2. We get rid of a bunch of unnecessary fields that chrome trace events\nforce upon us\n3. Serializing csexp is much faster\n\nAs a compromise, we add a conversion function to `$ dune trace cat` to\nget\nsomething resembling the old format\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2025-12-29T21:35:05Z",
          "tree_id": "281bd0b53732f7fb0a58c8cfe19298510a74078d",
