          "message": "Revert \"fix(ctypes): add proper user message for missing modules\" (#13123)\n\nThis reverts commit 87faddcc1b00d8802b5ec71ddf7e8dd798cdae37 from\n#12124.\n\nThe validation introduced in https://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/12124 is\nincorrect as explained in https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/13001.\nReproduction case is here https://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/13000. I\nwill merge these separately so it is easier to backport.\n\nThis PR reverts the PR that introduced the incorrect validation.\n\n- https://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/12124\n- https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/13001\n- https://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/13000",
