          "id": "e7bcc50fac3704ed3e36ab23a1918119767a82cb",
          "message": "feature: Action Tracing (#13267)\n\nThis PR introduces trace event collection for actions executed by dune.\nActions which are executed by dune may emit events into the\n`DUNE_ACTION_TRACE_DIR`. Such events are collected by dune and added\ninto the trace file.\n\nTo produce traces, users must use the `dune_action_trace` library. This\nlibrary is kept with minimal dependencies to make it as easy as possible\nfor users to collect such traces.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
