          "id": "b6db23f6779750278dccb9c0de5bf0a518bece94",
          "message": "feature: introduce a public action tracing library (#13348)\n\nThis library may be used by actions to produce trace events to enrich\ndune's own trace. Trace events all appear in _build/trace.csexp and may\nbe inspected with `dune trace cat` in a human readable format.\n\nThe library is quite simple so there's really not much more to describe.\nThe entire interface is this module\nhttps://github.com/ocaml/dune/blob/main/otherlibs/dune-action-trace/dune_action_trace.mli\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
