          "id": "6d200571c315f6f3240f6d34ac1793d97849ef10",
          "message": "refactor(oxcaml): split parameterised rules (#13413)\n\nA simple split of the `parameterised_rules.ml` file in two files (one\nfor the rules and one for printing the instances in the alias file), to\nprepare for the jsoo rules for OxCaml parameterised libs: Otherwise,\nthere'll be a cycle when `Parameterised_rules` starts calling\n`Jsoo_rules -> Compilation_context -> Parameterised_rules`. With this\nPR, the last module becomes `Parameterised_instances` which breaks the\ncycle.\n\nSigned-off-by: Arthur Wendling <arthur@tarides.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-01-22T10:10:41+01:00",
          "tree_id": "3cb637b757a632f94a1f6722cd18eeb9364b37cd",
