          "id": "270e12ce75ec30cec81083b4de1a4a807c5e730a",
          "message": "ci: reenable rocq (#13529)\n\nIn this PR we:\n- add rocq to the nix flake\n- fixup the output of all the rocq tests\n- fixup the output of all the rocq-native tests\n- re-enable the Rocq CI for both normal and native\n- remove coq from the nix flake and the ci",
          "timestamp": "2026-02-06T19:16:30+01:00",
          "tree_id": "6bee819991d2478bd28a9e4abf45b47a69030538",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/270e12ce75ec30cec81083b4de1a4a807c5e730a"
