          "id": "411f749c68b450351d9317f2bfcda17b262e6fee",
          "message": "slang: test and improve the simplification of slang (#13642)\n\nThe goal of this PR is two-fold, firstly to document the current\nsimplification behaviour and secondly to improve it.\n\nThe first commit in this PR adds tests for various cases we would expect\nslang to simplify. The subsequent cases all target a particular case and\nallow it to happen.\n\nThis will be used in \n- #13466 \n\nin order to simplify eagerly evaluated expressions and will be more\nuseful generally to reduce the duplication and complexity of portable\nlock directories.",
