          "id": "b51c3315ebdb96144444fe9e61b949c7477f04cd",
          "message": "Add expected output tests for Rocq. (#13632)\n\nWhen a `.v` file has a corresponding `.expected` file in a\n`rocq.theory`, Rocq's standard output is captured instead of being\noutput to the terminal, and the output is `diff`-ed with the `.expected`\nfile as part of the `runtest` alias.",
