          "id": "22379845759f4493d235c264101e9c5d6b51b88d",
          "message": "chore: skip install tests for dune-action-trace (#13736)\n\nWorkaround for https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/13732\n\nthis workaround sanctioned by @rgrinberg here:\nhttps://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/13730#pullrequestreview-3896247798\n\nTested in a fresh switch with\n\n```\nopam pin dune-action-trace.dev git@github.com:ocaml/dune.git#shonfeder/dune-action-trace-disable-install-tests --with-test --verbose\n```\n\nRelated: #13731 , which can help us prevent merging misconfigured\npackages in the future.",
