          "id": "7bc1d14fdf4947d77a5211ac51bd3dc607cd9994",
          "message": "fix(pkg): pass explicit -z/-j flags for non-auto-detecting tar (#13688)\n\nOpenBSD tar doesn't auto-detect compression format and requires explicit\n-z (gzip) or -j (bzip2) flags.\n\nThis adds tar implementation detection via --version output:\n- 'bsdtar' or 'libarchive' -> BSD tar (auto-detects compression)\n- 'GNU tar' -> GNU tar (auto-detects compression)\n- Otherwise -> Other (needs explicit flags)\n\nFixes #10123",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-07T13:38:23+01:00",
          "tree_id": "38e991f3dc4f26c882c257bffa70eb6b6549aa2e",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/7bc1d14fdf4947d77a5211ac51bd3dc607cd9994"
