          "message": "Add a howto guide for contexts (#13749)\n\n@Alizter mentioned about a tutorial on contexts in the [common docs\nissue](https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/12738#issuecomment-3913124365),\nand that rang a bell. I have struggled with it in the past and wrote\nsome notes after I figured out how to use the features. Writing a howto\nguide on multiple contexts. The context manual page has some details,\nbut this is to give a practical example of where the feature can be\nuseful.",
