          "id": "0303a40f715204490a6f8e490a79e1061139bea8",
          "message": "feature: revdep alias (#13800)\n\nThis alias is used to build all the reverse dependencies of all the\nlibraries in a particular directory. There's a few flavors of this\nalias:\n\n* `@revdep` to build `default` for every directory dependency\n* `@revdep-check` to build `check` for every directory dependency\n* `@revdep-runtest` to build `runtest` for every directory dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-18T23:11:20Z",
