          "message": "fix(pkg): substitute version variable in string interpolation (#13785)\n\nWhen a package is absent from the solution, its 'version' variable is\nknown to be empty. Substitute it at solve time in string interpolation\ncontexts.\n\nSplit off from \n- #13466\n\nAddresses `version` part of \n- #13660\n\nPart of the work on:\n- #13229",
