          "distinct": true,
          "id": "dd64d07339849bd974e16d61c9cc90dd37acbcca",
          "message": "Simplify changelog update process (#13873)\n\nPreviously, when running releases, we had to first generate the updated\nchangelog and then after producing the release and publish it, manually\nrestore the header material before merging the release branch back into\nmain.\n\nWith this change, we only need to run the changelog update, and this\nupdate can be directly merged into main, saving a manual step in the\nrelease process. This is achieved by simply replacing the more verbose\nheader and the (now) useless \"Unreleased\" section with a comment\nalerting readers to the generated nature of the file, and directing them\nto the documentation for adding changelog entries. This also allows us\nto deduplicate the docs about the changelog process.\n\nContributes to https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/13771",
          "timestamp": "2026-03-24T11:45:55-04:00",
          "tree_id": "78e8002dd0b58ac83ada8ab60919ea51e35cf834",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/dd64d07339849bd974e16d61c9cc90dd37acbcca"
