          "id": "8d89e28b8d57e8da6b36d7850fe558844a1a4f03",
          "message": "fix(signal_watcher): throw a `Code_error` instead of `assert false` (#14022)\n\non macOS, upon interrupting a process, sometimes I hit this assertion,\nand it's really hard to figure out which signal we should be handling\nhere.\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonio Nuno Monteiro <anmonteiro@gmail.com>",
