          "message": "Revert \"fix(signal-watcher): don't `assert false` on `SIGKILL` (#13370)\" (#14029)\n\nThis reverts commit 27e579541442f40a13efd97ca044512f80eae3e7.\n\n\nTurns out that the failure rather happens during SIGINT cleanup, where\nthe behavior of `SIGCHLD` is not super consistent on macOS. Repro in\nhttps://github.com/ocaml/dune/pull/14023\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonio Nuno Monteiro <anmonteiro@gmail.com>",
