          "id": "eec706f6be15bed80dd555e168b2f8490c83a322",
          "message": "rpc: clarify error when another dune instance is running (#13983)\n\n## Summary\n- improve forwarded-command error when another dune instance holds the\nglobal lock but RPC endpoint is unavailable\n- emit a clearer user-facing message: \"Another Dune instance is\ncurrently running. Aborting...\"\n- keep behavior deterministic (no pid in message) for stable cram\nexpectations\n- update cram test expectation in custom-build-dir case\n\n## Validation\n- opam exec -- ./dune.exe runtest\ntest/blackbox-tests/test-cases/cram/custom-build-dir.t\n\nFixes #13902\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Meet Zalavadiya <zalavadiyameet0806@gmail.com>\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>\nCo-authored-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-05T17:41:58+01:00",
          "tree_id": "329c3781e1a8006db24f8cb1cbcb58ea4b3b69f6",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/eec706f6be15bed80dd555e168b2f8490c83a322"
