          "message": "feat: allow multiple `(dirs ..)` stanzas (#13734)\n\nfixes #6249\n\n- as proposed in #6249, adds support for multiple `(dirs ..)` stanzas on\nthe same dune file\n- starting in version 3.23 of the dune language, we keep the\nintersection of the specified directories.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonio Nuno Monteiro <anmonteiro@gmail.com>",
