          "id": "d30662c5960c8dc5022c676785a8a5ee870973f2",
          "message": "Add depext to install `git-daemon` on Fedora (#14063)\n\n#14060 detects that `git-daemon` is available, but we also need to make\nsure the package is actually available. For this we add a depext here.\n\nThere's no `conf-git-daemon` package, so unless we submit it to\nopam-repository we'd need to ship the depext with us.\n\nCloses #14027\n\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>",
