          "id": "a548ec69e97894c80d3b3044860f95aca0791013",
          "message": "Add documentation for depexts (#13657) (#13831)\n\nAdd a new reference page documenting external system dependencies\n(`depexts`):\n- declaration in opam files,\n- lock directory format (standard and portable),\n- the dune show depexts command,\n- platform variables with environment overrides, and\n- build failure hints.\n\nThis is a first PR to lay the groundwork (reference docs) for #13657.\nThere will be one or more followups to add the remaining new pages\n(tutorial, how to), and to make the addition to the existing doc.",
