          "id": "d07f40295a3907c7046138f1ded80e8517859b52",
          "message": "test(rpc): reproduce shutdown bugs (#14327)\n\nAdd expect tests covering the RPC shutdown issues found during review:\n\n- a server-initiated request that stays pending after the client\ndisconnects\n- a client reply that raises while writing after the channel is closed\n- a client request that raises when sent after close\n\nKeep the server-side pending-request test focused by using a lenient\ntest client that drops closed-write errors instead of failing first.\n\nAlso annotate the remaining csexp RPC transport ownership bug in\nClient.connect: failed connects retain the socket until stop is called,\nand stop can still close the live session transport after a successful\nconnect.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-25T16:15:22+01:00",
