          "id": "ba4e542ba27af16b7bd06e7f2dd2aad83cd4a4c3",
          "message": "test: observational baseline for per-module rebuild counts (#14310)\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds a blackbox cram test that records the rebuild-target count for a\nconsumer module `C` when each of three entry modules (`A1`, `A2`, `A3`)\nof an unwrapped dependency library has its interface edited. `C`\nreferences only `A2`.\n\nOn current main, editing any of `A1`/`A2`/`A3` rebuilds `C`\n(conservative\nglob dep over the dependency's object dir). The recorded counts are\n`A1=1`, `A3=1`, `A2>0`. Once per-module tightening (#4572) lands, `A1`\nand `A3` counts go to zero and a later PR promotes the test output.\n\nRelated: #4572, #14116\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Robin Bate Boerop <me@robinbb.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-04-27T15:01:32-07:00",
          "tree_id": "261611fe2269a93d06502259538a4f617e7f8dc3",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/ba4e542ba27af16b7bd06e7f2dd2aad83cd4a4c3"
