          "message": "rpc: replace Global Fiber.Var with a ref (#14387)\n\nThe RPC server handle in `Rpc.Global` does not need fiber-local dynamic\nscope. Replace the `Fiber.Var` with a module-level reference and restore\nthe previous value when `with_background_rpc` exits.\n\nThis keeps the existing behavior for `ensure_ready` and `stop` while\nremoving the extra fiber variable machinery.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
