          "id": "84c87609a6a43431e64398274beeeb3d2fab48c7",
          "message": "Fiber: add map-reduce helpers (#14503)\n\nAdd map_reduce_seq, map_reduce_array, and map_reduce for running fibers\nconcurrently over sequences, arrays, and lists, then combining their\nresults with an explicit ~combine function.\n\nExpose the helpers through Memo, cover each collection shape with expect\ntests, and migrate order-insensitive reductions over dependency sets,\npath sets, and cached table entries to the new helpers.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
