          "message": "test: pps runtime libs reach cinaps compile rule (#14607)\n\nPins that a `(cinaps ...)` stanza preprocessing with a ppx whose\n`(ppx_runtime_libraries ...)` is non-empty includes a glob over the\nruntime lib's `.cmi` objdir in the cinaps exe's compile-rule dep set —\neven though no source names the runtime lib syntactically.\n\nForward-looking regression guard for the per-module narrowing work under\n#14492.\n\nSigned-off-by: Robin Bate Boerop <me@robinbb.com>",
