          "id": "27d2cadec50ae196977932d71dfdc3c7069cceca",
          "message": "refactor(inotify): process raw events on watcher thread (#14670)\n\nTranslate raw inotify events before handing them to the scheduler.\nProtect the watch table with a mutex so adding a watch remains atomic\nwith publishing its path, and update callers to consume\nalready-processed events.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-23T11:11:59+02:00",
          "tree_id": "efc90aec7e2996ef4be723c4da4caf433176d49c",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/27d2cadec50ae196977932d71dfdc3c7069cceca"
