          "id": "619a944b086e3a4faff0e094237ebd8b720ded07",
          "message": "Clean up file watcher internals (#14676)\n\nRemove the unused scheduler field stored in the Windows watcher variant.\n\nAlso replace an unreachable assertion in the fsevents watch trie with a\nCode_error and update an obsolete comment in the fsevents sync watcher.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-05-24T00:18:22+02:00",
          "tree_id": "864150fe205e914fd0307a76fa4037e8fd864b87",
