          "message": "Fix parent directory watches for external files (#14702)\n\nWhen an external file was added to the watcher, parent_directory walked\nup to an existing directory but returned the original path instead of\nthe directory it found. Fsevents and the Windows watcher could therefore\ntry to watch the file path rather than its containing directory.\n\nReturn the discovered directory and use it when installing external\nwatches.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
