          "id": "6a604e04d0ec02b3421616cefdb22bb2048ce325",
          "message": "Trace file watcher events in the scheduler (#14722)\n\nOnly the inotify backend emitted file watcher trace events. Fsevents,\nexternal fswatch, and the Windows watcher returned events to the\nscheduler without recording them in the trace.\n\nEmit trace entries in the common scheduler path that executes\nfile-watcher jobs, so all current and future backends are covered\nwithout per-backend wrappers.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
