          "id": "2fd4cdb2921ef732908d039a4c4697c50f193e0a",
          "message": "test: document resolve_program resolution in lock-kind contexts (#14737)\n\nThis test aims to capture the current behavior when resolving programs\nin stanzas like `(ocamllex ...)` or `(menhir ...)`. The resolution\ncurrently falls through to `Pkg_rules.which` that currently scans every\nlocked package's binary index. So, any binary installed by any locked\npackage is discoverable from any stanza.\n\nBut, this dependency also means that resolving the programs for these\nstanzas has a dependency on building all the lockdir packages which is\none of the problems to be fixed for #8652.",
