          "id": "a0c2f21c442d78fa359204ae6f259250f3d988cf",
          "message": "Fix FSEvents watcher startup and failure propagation (#14764)\n\nPublish the dispatch queue only after both source and sync streams start\nsuccessfully. If starting the sync stream fails, stop the source stream\nand propagate the captured exception to the caller instead of leaving\nstartup in a partially initialized state.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
