          "id": "b940d9da7e868ca3e2e36bc1226961bf9b54bd78",
          "message": "Update vendored cmdliner to 2.1.1 (#14636)\n\nFixes #12515.\nThis PR pulls in all the changes from cmdliner 2.1.1, see changelog\n[here](https://ocaml.org/p/cmdliner/latest/CHANGES.html).\nAmong these changes, there are new error messages formats, so that's a\nbig diff on that commit.\nOn top of the released cmdliner, there is a singular patch to keep\nsupport for aliases.\nThis has the non-insignificant bonus of simplifying maintenance of our\nfork over at https://github.com/ocaml-dune/cmdliner",
