          "message": "test: cover cross-workspace cache restore (#14762)\n\nAdd a cache cram test showing that a regular file target produced in one\nworkspace can be restored in another workspace when both use the same\nshared cache in copy mode.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
