          "id": "e75cb27a9156669fd1a92dc646fd7381ee92236f",
          "message": "fix(cache): refresh copy-mode entries on restore (#14777)\n\nCopy-mode cache entries always have one link, so trimming orders them by\nctime. After successfully restoring an artifact by copy, refresh the\ncache entry ctime with a no-op chmod so recently restored entries are\nkept. Treat refresh failures as best-effort because the restore copy has\nalready succeeded.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
