          "message": "doc: explain dev and release profiles (#15025)\n\nDocument the practical differences between the standard `dev` and\n`release` build profiles.\n\nThe new text explains the default profile, warnings-as-errors,\n`-opaque`, inline tests, and which profile to use for distributed\nartifacts. It also notes that user-defined profiles are not aliases for\neither standard profile.\n\nFixes #6447.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
