          "id": "0780201ae0d20d99285c99777eb577a6689b76ee",
          "message": "doc: clarify run action program lookup (#15027)\n\nClarify that `(run <prog> ...)` does not search the workspace source\ntree for arbitrary executable files. It only resolves binaries known to\nDune command lookup, external programs from PATH, or explicit paths.\n\nCloses #4031.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
