          "id": "462817ac5c4c53d84b33cc0d7d77e9af49d19bf3",
          "message": "doc: clarify root path variables (#15024)\n\nClarify that `%{project_root}` and `%{workspace_root}` refer to roots in\nthe current build context rather than directly to the source checkout.\n\nAlso document that path variables in actions are rendered relative to\nthe action working directory, and remind users to declare source files\nas dependencies before reading them.\n\nFixes #4004.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
