          "id": "7ff600b6854a7bc6c26286e189c78bd596879fb8",
          "message": "refactor(memo): move the error handler into its own module (#15037)\n\nMove the error handler from `memo.ml` into its own module\n`src/memo/error_handler.ml` (+ `.mli`).\n\n`Error_handler` collects, deduplicates, and reports the exceptions\nraised while\nrunning a computation. It depends only on the core error types, so it\nmoves out\ncleanly behind a small interface.\n\nPure code motion; behaviour is unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
