          "id": "9ee2d195f46db0d894f65c6818de855f2e3601c6",
          "message": "refactor(memo): move the execution engine into exec.ml (#15039)\n\nMove the execution engine from `memo.ml` into `src/memo/exec.ml`.\n\n`Exec` holds the core evaluation logic —\n`consider_and_restore_from_cache`,\n`consider_and_compute`, `compute`, `exec_dep_node`, the\n`report_and_collect_errors` wrapper, the `Non_reproducible` exception,\nthe\n`check_point` hook, and the run-tracking refs. `memo.ml` re-exports\n`Non_reproducible` and `check_point` and calls into `Exec` for\nevaluation.\n\nThis is the last large block to leave `memo.ml`, which is now\nessentially the\npublic glue (cells, lazy, `Poly`, `run`/`reset`, invalidation, etc.)\nover the\n`node`/`value`/`deps`/`deps_collector`/`parallel`/`error_handler`/`exec`\nmodules.\n\nPure code motion; behaviour is unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
