          "id": "2dd06760e44693abce03ca0b9c68e22be7c01b76",
          "message": "refactor(memo): add interfaces for deps_collector, parallel and exec (#15040)\n\nAdd interfaces for the three implementation-only modules extracted in\nthe\npreceding commits: `deps_collector.mli`, `parallel.mli`, and `exec.mli`.\nThe\nmodules were moved out of `memo.ml` without interfaces; the `.mli`s now\nconstrain and document the surface each one exposes.\n\nThis completes the split of `memo.ml` into focused modules — `node`,\n`value`,\n`deps`, `deps_collector`, `parallel`, `error_handler`, `exec` — each\nbehind an\ninterface.\n\nInterface-only change; behaviour is unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
