          "message": "doc: clarify alias-only rules (#15069)\n\nClarify when a `rule` stanza may omit `target`/`targets`, including\nrules attached only to aliases for commands that do not produce files.\n\nAlso add an example of replacing an old `alias` action with a `rule`\nusing the `alias` field.\n\nFixes #4202.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
