          "message": "test: expose external build dir install paths (#15087)\n\nThis extracts the regression coverage from #15077 into a standalone\ntest-only PR.\n\nThe new tests demonstrate #11774 by expecting installed dune-package\nartifact paths to be relative even when DUNE_BUILD_DIR is an absolute\ndirectory outside the workspace. This PR is expected to fail until the\nfix from #15077 (or equivalent) is applied.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
