          "id": "93c3245969ea5908a8d8e45cb5f827bf0dd4c0c6",
          "message": "fix(vcs): contextualize missing git errors (#14994)\n\nFixes #10393.\n\nMissing `git` errors now include context about the Dune feature that\nrequired Git, such as `dune subst`, build-info/artifact substitution, or\npackage management.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
