          "message": "doc: improve man/help of dune build (#15083)\n\nThis is one of the first man pages people might read about `dune`. It's\ntherefore important it is more informative than our usual lazy style.\n\nI've mentioned some newer features we have since this document was last\nupdated and expanded upon what a `TARGET` accepted by dune actually\nentails.",
