          "id": "77ab1a8cb384ab5a9b86a8189bc479d692dab731",
          "message": "test(memo): cover Run.Pair timestamp packing (#15121)\n\nAdd explicit round-trip tests for `Run.Pair`, which packs a cached\nvalue's\n`(last_changed_at, last_validated_at)` timestamps into a single\nimmediate int\nunder the invariant `last_changed_at <= last_validated_at`. Covers the\ninvalid\npair, equal endpoints, the `-1` lower bound, a wide gap near the packing\nheadroom, and `with_last_validated_at` preserving `last_changed_at`.\n\nUses the `Run.For_tests` handles added earlier in this series.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
