          "id": "a6a4ef6f60bc17db6480722627c1a1a5b57542ff",
          "message": "doc: clarify what @doc generates (#15129)\n\nClarify that `@doc` is package-oriented: it builds public library API\ndocumentation and package `.mld` pages, but not executable stanzas. This\nshould make the behavior of executable-only projects less surprising.\n\nI checked for open PRs first. No open PR currently references #3334. The\nclosest related open PR is the draft odoc v3 rewrite (#12995), but this\ndocumentation clarification is independent of that work.\n\nFixes #3334.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
