          "message": "chore: add another review prompt (#15132)\n\nI found our code review prompt to be somewhat annoying to use in\npractice. It steers the modle to be nitpicky and point out a lot of\nstuff that is not relevant for a first review pass. Here's a simplified\nprompt that only focuses on the most important bits.\n\nI also removed the review section from the general AGENTS.md. These\nreview tasks are easily invoked via a slash command from inside the\nharness anyway.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
