          "message": "feat(configurator): expose pkg-config variable queries (#15078)\n\nAdd `Configurator.V1.Pkg_config.query_variable`, a small wrapper for\n`pkg-config --variable=<name> <package>`, so configurator users can\nquery package-specific variables such as `prefix`.\n\nThe implementation reuses configurator’s existing pkg-config argument\nand macOS Homebrew environment handling.\n\nCloses #3332.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
