          "id": "91930541921afd0b70ea09586e5d6fb749c24e10",
          "message": "doc: clarify default alias interaction with tests (#15185)\n\nClarify the distinction between `dune build` / `@default` and `dune\nruntest` / `@runtest`. In particular, document that plain `dune build`\ndoes not run `runtest` actions, but the implicit `default` alias\nrecursively depends on `all`, so it can still build test executables or\ngenerated test artifacts.\n\nAlso document that excluding a tests subtree from plain builds should be\ndone by overriding `default` in a parent directory, not inside the tests\ndirectory itself.\n\nFixes #11217.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-12T23:21:01+01:00",
          "tree_id": "11d17ca4b2c9ae29779d39737b14741acf2b8b59",
