          "message": "scheduler: discard unknown child exits (#15223)\n\nThe process watcher no longer stores exit statuses for PIDs that were\nnot registered as running jobs. Keep the table scoped to registered jobs\nso unknown children are traced and ignored instead of being cached for a\nfuture PID reuse.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
