          "id": "d9a6ca7caeff6c409de0ef2ad86703c319eded81",
          "message": "refactor(action-runner): run process monitor with task pool (#15268)\n\nStart action-runner process monitoring from Action_runner.run instead of\nlazily from readiness checks. This keeps readiness waiting focused on\nthe runner handshake, prevents run from being called twice, and closes\nthe task pool once the single expected ready request has been handled.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
