          "id": "f7c61ce455303446641fdab4d9a62f4e7f781075",
          "message": "fix(exec): stop scheduler before exec emulation (#15286)\n\nOn Windows, restore_cwd_and_execve emulates exec by running at_exit\nhandlers before spawning the replacement process. Those handlers include\nUnix cleanup, which calls WSACleanup. Make dune exec prepare the\nexecutable path and environment inside the scheduler, then leave the\nscheduler/RPC scope before invoking restore_cwd_and_execve.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
