          "message": "fix(lev): improve Windows libev diagnostics (#15287)\n\nInstall a Windows libev syserr callback that prints both errno and\nWSAGetLastError, including the formatted Windows system message. This\nmakes fatal libev socket errors report the useful Winsock code instead\nof only an unhelpful CRT strerror string.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
