          "id": "32de1af7a17f849f18039f73328fb581fc0ff987",
          "message": "test(pkg): repro @doc-new crash on locked META-only lib (#15290) (#15292)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Adds a cram reproduction for\n[#15290](https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/15290): `dune build\n@doc-new` with package management enabled crashes with\n`as_outside_build_dir_exn` when a locked package exposes a library\nthrough a META file only (no `dune-package`).\n- The odoc-new fallback path (`Odoc_new.modules_of_dir`) calls\n`Path.as_outside_build_dir_exn` on the lib's cmti directory, but for\nlock-dir packages that directory lives inside\n`_build/_private/.../target/lib/<lib>`.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] `dune runtest\ntest/blackbox-tests/test-cases/pkg/doc-new-with-locked-lib.t`",
