          "id": "4d89cd6d5f6246996db8c4c12ae5d0ee77836a15",
          "message": "nix: stop pinning source dune in the ox devShell (#15299)\n\nThe `ox` shell overrode `dune_3` to `self.packages.<system>.default`, so\nevery OCaml package in its closure was re-hashed on every source change.\nThe cache-nix-action restore in CI then fell back to a stale prefix\nmatch and rebuilt the OxCaml compiler and dependent packages from\nscratch.\n\nDrop the override so the closure rebuilds dune from upstream nixpkgs\nagainst the OxCaml compiler, like `ox-minimal` already does. The shell\nstill picks up the local build via `_boot/dune.exe` through the\n`duneScript` wrapper on PATH.",
          "timestamp": "2026-06-24T12:37:52+01:00",
          "tree_id": "6620263452f2a8d0ccd72810d3c1ba414d583f78",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/4d89cd6d5f6246996db8c4c12ae5d0ee77836a15"
