          "id": "56b32257600320a05305161990eafccdc3b1158c",
          "message": "test(clean): demonstrate that clean rejects source directories (#2288) (#15300)\n\nReproduces #2288: `dune clean` does not accept source directories (or\npackage\nnames) the way `dune build`/`dune runtest` do — it only accepts paths\ninside\nthe build directory (a capability added in #13875).\n\nThis adds a test to `clean.t` documenting the current behaviour:\n\n- `dune build sub` accepts the source directory\n- `dune clean sub` fails with `Error: sub is not inside the build\ndirectory`\n- `dune clean .` fails likewise\n\nNo behaviour change — the test pins the status quo so it will flip to\nthe\ndesired output if/when `dune clean` learns to accept source directories.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
