          "message": "refactor(nix): extract dune-package.nix from flake.nix (#15302)\n\nMove `dune-source`, `dune-build-files`, the static overlay, and the\n`packages.{default,dune-static}` derivations out into their own module\nunder `nix/`. Matches the shape of the existing `nix/revdeps.nix`,\n`nix/menhir.nix`, and `nix/ox-package-set.nix` helpers.\n\nHash-stable: `nix eval .#packages.<system>.default.outPath` produces the\nsame store path before and after.",
