          "id": "5d75d58d5504da7542fda6a869ffbced7fb6ad26",
          "message": "refactor(nix): inline nixpkgs-old into bootstrap-check (#15304)\n\n`nixpkgs-old` is pinned to a single rev for OCaml 4.02 support and\nconsumed by exactly one buildInput in `bootstrap-check`. Drop the flake\ninput and inline the `fetchTree` + `import` in a `let` adjacent to\nbootstrap-check itself. No top-level binding, no intermediate `pkgs-old`\noverlay (the `ocaml-overlays` overlay previously applied on top of\n`nixpkgs-old.legacyPackages` had no effect on\n`ocaml-ng.ocamlPackages_4_02.ocaml`).\n\nRemoves the corresponding `follows` entry in `revdeps-dune`;\nrevdeps-dune resolves its own pin from its own flake.lock.\n\nHash-stable: `bootstrap-check` resolves to the same store path before\nand after.",
