          "message": "refactor(rpc): remove background RPC wrapper (#15270)\n\nRun the Dune RPC server explicitly around scheduler execution instead of\nkeeping a separate background state machine in dune_rpc_impl. Action\nplugins can rely on the scheduler-level RPC server lifetime, so they no\nlonger force RPC startup.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
