          "message": "refactor(nix): extract rocq devShells into nix/devShells/rocq.nix (#15318)\n\nMove `rocq` and `rocq-native` (and their per-shell `extraOCamlOverlays`)\ninto their own module under `nix/devShells/`, following the same shape\nas `nix/devShells/ox.nix`.\n\n`flake.nix` consumes the two shells via:\n\n  inherit (import ./nix/devShells/rocq.nix { … }) rocq rocq-native;\n\nHash-stable: both shells produce the same store paths before and after.",
