          "message": "fix(nix): quote args expansion to pass args faithfully (#15342)\n\nThe wrapper script around _boot/dune.exe used `$@` directly which caused\ninvocations such as `dune build '(alias foo)'` to get interpreted as\nhaving two args `'(alias` and `foo)'`. This can be fixed by\ndouble-quoting the args variable.",
