          "id": "ba99f27ffba08b499a2758bc0326e0e119b9a591",
          "message": "fix(rpc): show client count for batch servers (#15346)\n\nInstall the RPC client-count status-line section for every RPC lifecycle\nrun instead of tying it to registry publication. Batch builds use a\ntemporary RPC server without writing a registry entry, but they should\nstill refresh the [rpc n] section while clients are connected.\n\nExtend the status-line cram test to cover a batch build with a held RPC\nclient.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
