          "message": "refactor(sexp): use stdlib utf-8 decoding (#15353)\n\nUse String.get_utf_8_uchar for sexp string escaping now that Dune\nrequires OCaml 4.14, and drop the Uutf dependency from dune_sexp and\nbootstrap inputs.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
