          "message": "feature(watch): show build parallelism in status line (#15390)\n\nTrack elapsed time for build processes in metrics and use it to compute\nthe average process parallelism shown by watch-mode status timers.\nSnapshot the completed build's process time before resetting the metric\nso the last-build status line remains stable.\n\nRemove the action-execution duration accumulator now that process\nduration is recorded directly when build processes finish.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
