          "id": "1544087398afbd8a0aac2586f04f9ce786c0e945",
          "message": "test: demonstrate dune fmt not re-running after revert (#15379)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Adds a cram test\n`test/blackbox-tests/test-cases/formatting/fmt-after-revert.t` that\nrecords a bug in `dune fmt`.\n- The test runs `dune fmt` on an unformatted `dune` file (which works),\nreverts the file back to its unformatted state, and runs `dune fmt`\nagain — the second invocation does nothing.\n- Expected behaviour: `dune fmt` should reformat an unformatted file on\nevery invocation. The recorded output flags the bug with an in-test\n`CR-soon` comment so the fix can flip the assertions.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `dune runtest\ntest/blackbox-tests/test-cases/formatting/fmt-after-revert.t` passes\n(recording current buggy behaviour).\n\nSigned-off-by: Ali Caglayan <alizter@gmail.com>",
