          "message": "test(rpc): cover batch shutdown with monitor client (#15366)\n\nAdd a regression test for a batch RPC server shutting down while an\ninitialized dune monitor client has long-poll requests in flight. The\ntest waits until the monitor is connected before releasing the build, so\nit exercises the stuck batch-server case.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
