          "id": "bfde3bcd6e9981769b100327de412ec524c0a91a",
          "message": "fix(root-module): ignore ppx runtime dependencies (#15419)\n\nGenerate root modules from user-written stanza dependencies instead of\nthe\nfull compile dependency set, so PPX runtime libraries are not exposed\nthrough\nthe generated root module.\n\nTechnically, this is a breaking change. But this is such a sparsely used\nfeature, and the old behaviour was so completely useless and harmful,\nthat we can just bite the bullet here. It's a shame that there's no way\nto restrict ppx runtime dependencies to be only usable in generated\ncode.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
