          "id": "434a2619f2c5d830ca3dbb213ed81ca24b042b9b",
          "message": "Disable `flambda` in Nix (#15454)\n\nThe nix-overlay enables `flambda` automatically and in the flake we\ndisable it for `dune`. However, this is\nnot the case for `dune-static`, where we use the regular `ocaml` package\n(from the overlay) continues to use `flambda`.\n\nThis disables flambda in both `dune-static` as well as `dune`, according\nto the decision from the Dune developer meeting on 2026-07-08.\n\nSigned-off-by: Marek Kubica <marek@tarides.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-09T17:01:00+02:00",
