          "message": "scheduler: wait for process groups after actions exit (#14868)\n\nAfter a process-group leader exits, check whether its group still\ncontains processes. If so, send SIGTERM, poll for the group to\ndisappear, escalate to SIGKILL after the existing grace period, and\nabort if it still remains.\n\nExtend the cram subprocess test with a SIGTERM-ignoring background job.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-09T23:26:07+01:00",
