          "message": "fix(stdune): treat ENOTDIR as a missing path (#15475)\n\nHave Fpath.exists and Fpath.is_directory return false when an\nintermediate path\ncomponent is not a directory. This prevents default user config probing\nfrom\ncrashing when XDG_CONFIG_HOME/dune is a regular file.\n\nAdd stdune coverage and update the gh-15406 cram regression to expect\nsuccess.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
