          "message": "test(install): update file-as-directory error output (#15479)\n\nnnwsrxss made Fpath.exists and Fpath.is_directory treat ENOTDIR like a\nmissing\npath. During install, that lets the check for prefix/lib/foo/META\nproceed until\nmkdir_p sees that prefix/lib/foo is a file, so the error is now the\ninstaller’s\nfriendly “Please delete file ...” diagnostic.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
