          "message": "feature(trace): emit OCaml runtime events (#15468)\n\nAdd a runtime trace category backed by runtime_events. When runtime\ntracing is\nenabled, initialize runtime event collection, poll it during scheduler\nidle\npoints and trace shutdown, and translate runtime phases/counters into\ntrace\nevents.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
