          "message": "fix(fs_memo): include ctime in digest cache stats (#15495)\n\nRecord ctime in Stdune.Stat and in the persistent digest database's\ncached\nsource-file metadata. This catches same-size edits that restore mtime\nbefore\nDune decides whether to trust a cached digest.\n\nUpdate the stale source digest regression test to expect a rebuild\nwithout\nremoving _build.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
