          "message": "test(cross-module-opt-deps): exercise sandboxed output (#15508)\n\n## Description\n\nExercise sandboxed custom-stdlib output at runtime and record the\ncurrent broken import.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nRelated to #15376.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests added, if applicable.\n- [ ] Change log entry added, if applicable.\n- [ ] Documentation added, if applicable.\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonio Nuno Monteiro <anmonteiro@gmail.com>",
