          "id": "e5f64f04c748667137aba582685cfa90eca40a2b",
          "message": "fix(spawn): report macOS chdir errors correctly (#15526)\n\nThe private pthread chdir syscalls follow the usual syscall convention:\nthey return -1 and place the actual error in errno. Passing the return\nvalue to unix_error produced an unknown error instead of the underlying\nfailure.\n\nCapture errno for path- and descriptor-based working directories, and\ninclude the requested path in path-based exceptions.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
