          "message": "ci: enable runtime5 for OxCaml trunk (#15595)\n\n## Summary\n\n- evaluate OxCaml trunk through its own flake so its runtime5\nconfiguration and locked Nix dependencies are used\n- preserve the compiler metadata required by the OCaml package scope\n- build OxCaml with the source-tree Dune and provide its development\nversion during bootstrap\n\nThis fixes the `Revdeps development build` failure after OxCaml trunk\nmoved to 5.4 and stopped supporting runtime4.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `nix develop .#ox-minimal-trunk --impure -c true`\n- `nix fmt -- nix/devShells/ox.nix`\n- `./dune.exe build @check`\n- `git diff --check`",
