          "message": "test(watch): reproduce duplicate eager RPC diagnostics (#15610)\n\n## Summary\n\n- add a synchronized regression test for duplicate eager-watch\ndiagnostics\n- verify that the failing action stays memoized while eager watch mode\nemits its diagnostic twice after an RPC build request\n\nRelated issue: #15609. This PR is test-only; follow-up work will address\nthe bug.\n\n## Testing\n\n- `./dune.exe runtest\ntest/blackbox-tests/test-cases/watching/eager-rpc-double-diagnostics.t`\n- `./dune.exe fmt`",
