          "id": "4fd6103f88400ed4cb752f780dc221e47eda9631",
          "message": "test(pkg): validate-lockdir on a self-referencing constraint (#15617)\n\n## Description\n\nAdd a regression test showing that `dune pkg validate-lockdir` accepts\nan invalid lockdir when a local package dependency constraint refers to\nthe package own version with `:version`.\n\nThe solver evaluates local dependency formulas with the package name and\nversion bound as self variables. Validation currently evaluates the same\nformula without those bindings, so the guarded version constraint is\nsilently dropped.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nThis is the first change in the fix series and captures the current\nbehavior before the validation fix.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests added, if applicable.\n- [x] Change log entry not applicable; this is a test-only change.\n- [x] Documentation not applicable; this is a test-only change.",
          "timestamp": "2026-07-29T13:33:41+01:00",
          "tree_id": "4d3ea061e5d29c43ed6bdbd699f13086de3a43f5",
