          "message": "agents: use shorter review skill (#15625)\n\nThe review skill I introduced seems to be outperformed by the shorter\none on all models that I've tested (fable 5, sol 5.6, kimi k3, deepseek\nv4). Performance was measured by taking a few PRs with known reviews and\ncomparing them across models x short/verbose.\n\nWe remove the verbose review skill in favour of the shorter one.\n\nBefore we had a split where claude and GitHub copilot would use the\nverbose one, now they all use the same review check skill.",
