          "message": "test(rpc): reproduce skipped registry scan (#15632)\n\nAdd a deterministic RPC registry polling test with controlled IO. The\ntest polls an empty registry, adds a valid entry while changing the\ndirectory mtime, and records that the changed and subsequent polls\nneither rescan nor discover the entry.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
