          "message": "fix(fs-io): return Unix errors from read_file (#15641)\n\n`Fs_io.read_file` returns a result, but opening a nonexistent file\ncurrently raises `Unix_error` instead of returning it. Catch Unix errors\naround descriptor-based file access so callers receive `Error`\nconsistently.\n\nThis updates the regression expectation introduced in #15639.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
