          "id": "208a3766cf9440324208a19b169b8da1ae83a9f0",
          "message": "feature: show build timing in batch mode (#15564)\n\nDisplay build duration and average process parallelism in the status\nline for batch builds. Share timing formatting with watch mode and add\nregression coverage for batch status output.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T23:47:42+01:00",
          "tree_id": "947d08988f145d3c098ff3411b95c9a14894fe60",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/208a3766cf9440324208a19b169b8da1ae83a9f0"
