          "message": "refactor(engine): pack cached file stats into a string (#15670)\n\nStore cached stat fields at fixed offsets in a string while preserving\ntheir\nexisting dynamic representation. Bump the workspace cache format\nversion.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
