          "message": "feature(watch): show build run in status line (#15673)\n\nShow the current watch-mode build run at the end of the status line as\n`[N]`. The number increments for each watch build, while batch status\noutput remains unchanged.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
