          "id": "55baf4f5c0ddc1d36a662635ca3d2d60e7a00abe",
          "message": "perf(stdune): avoid allocations in nonempty-list comparison (#15681)\n\n`Nonempty_list.compare` destructured its arguments and then rebuilt both\nlist\nheads before calling `List.compare`, allocating two temporary list cells\nfor\nevery comparison.\n\nCompare the heads directly and delegate only the tails to\n`List.compare`. This\nreduced minor allocation by 1.72M words (13 MiB) in a cold Dune\nself-build and\nby 1.33M words (10 MiB) in a no-op build.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-04T21:38:51+01:00",
          "tree_id": "a7caa4dabd2092ab63190a1a0afedb7d3b9cf735",
