          "id": "5f65691ab2647f9d13ddbc427d943e192ef598c9",
          "message": "fix(stdune): correct filesystem metric accounting (#15686)\n\nFilesystem metrics currently charge file-write time to unrelated read\nmetrics, while the directory counter is incremented only once when its\nmodule is initialized.\n\nCorrect the write attribution, count and time complete directory scans,\nand add regression tests for both behaviors.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
