          "message": "change(status): calculate parallelism from CPU time (#15685)\n\nCalculate status-line parallelism from accumulated user and system CPU\ntime instead of action wall time. Preserve wall-clock process metrics\nfor tracing and fall back to wall time when resource usage is\nunavailable, including on Windows.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
