          "id": "c42bd8dd9b16bbbdf15ea148e3145341ce20461a",
          "message": "fix(trace): preserve runtime event ring IDs (#15687)\n\nOCaml runtime-event callbacks identify the ring buffer that produced\neach event, but Dune currently discards that information while\nserializing its trace. Events from different streams are therefore\nindistinguishable, making begin/end pairing unreliable when streams\ninterleave.\n\nPreserve the ring ID on runtime phase and counter events, and verify\nboth serialized event shapes.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-04T23:19:31+01:00",
          "tree_id": "dd75a6924d13c7f7558c4ec0fbd6f52bcfe0cf8d",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/c42bd8dd9b16bbbdf15ea148e3145341ce20461a"
