          "id": "cebc0c84cf6552e51af34b57628443876b07f447",
          "message": "test: expose spurious package layout cache miss (#15677)\n\n## Description\n\nAdd a cram reproduction showing that rebuilding an unchanged target with\na\n`(package ...)` dependency pointlessly invalidates and rebuilds its\nmaterialized\n`.packages` install layout. The cache trace records both the\nworkspace-local\nmiss (`target missing from build dir`) and the resulting shared-cache\nmiss.\n\nThis is analogous to #15674 and intentionally captures the existing\nbehavior;\nthe fix is kept separate.",
