          "id": "6d44981557fb02b6d2c505592ce387e73637bc3f",
          "message": "chore: update release process documentation (#13953)\n\nUpdates the documented process and the release tracking issue template\nwith streamlined and up to date process.\n\nA good portion of this will be replaced with reference to scripts or CI\njobs that can perform the actions, but iterative refinement of\ndocumentation of this kind of operational stuff is part of the process\nto developing automation.\n\nContributes to #13771",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-05T15:25:14-04:00",
          "tree_id": "461faa4e69e24a1e718a7591a5fa6043e40a06a0",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/6d44981557fb02b6d2c505592ce387e73637bc3f"
