          "distinct": true,
          "id": "8eed6d6bc4f4e0b1fd18fa37eea834dda19634d2",
          "message": "fix: preserve internal install layouts across builds (#15678)\n\n## Description\n\nPreserve the engine-owned `.binaries` and `.packages` directories when\nloading\n`_build/install/<context>`. Without this declaration, stale-artifact\ncleanup\ndeletes both layouts before their child rule generators run, causing\npointless\ncache misses, symlink recreation, and persistent rule-cache rewrites on\nnull\nbuilds.\n\nThe two cram reproductions now expect no cache misses on an unchanged\nsecond\nbuild.\n\nDepends on:\n\n- #15674\n- #15677",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-05T22:04:56+02:00",
          "tree_id": "ccafbe76701bb017a6a71f3d53380944de7db0ef",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/8eed6d6bc4f4e0b1fd18fa37eea834dda19634d2"
