          "id": "4b17788d4bae137f9d8bbb99a1a419b7c0f5fe5d",
          "message": "perf(stdune): join external paths without a temporary list (#15694)\n\nPath_external.relative constructs a two-element list solely to pass two\nstrings\nto String.concat. Write the slash-separated result into one correctly\nsized\nbuffer instead.\n\nA sampled self-build attributes 1.77M words (13.5 MiB) cold and 0.63M\nwords\n(4.8 MiB) no-op to the removed list cells.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
