          "id": "41ea191ef9afef5cc473e9ab50cb961876b683b8",
          "message": "Add script for cutting releases (#15558)\n\n## Description\n\nA bash script to automate the process of cutting releases. It still has\nsome missing edge cases and I'm not confident in it's ability run\ncorrectly in all cases. I will be doing more testing on my fork before\nrequesting reviews.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nFixes https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/14281",
