          "id": "4bd366ab2f24759e56af0b15a40e600e23c9aecb",
          "message": "perf(source): avoid memo branches for ordinary files (#15722)\n\nAvoid creating Memo branches for ordinary files while scanning source\ndirectories; keep them only for directories and symlinks. Test coverage\nis in #15719.\n\nI ran the source directory scanning microbenchmarks locally on\n`17ccab3ce3`, for 5 seconds per case. Results:\n\nBase:\n\n```text\n┌────────────┬─────────────┬─────────────┬──────────────┐\n│ Files      │    Time/Run │     mWd/Run │     mjWd/Run │\n├────────────┼─────────────┼─────────────┼──────────────┤\n│        100 │     17.91us │     12.18kw │       31.57w │\n│      1,000 │    288.84us │    127.22kw │   10_119.44w │\n│     10,000 │  3_688.59us │  1_355.08kw │  173_861.44w │\n└────────────┴─────────────┴─────────────┴──────────────┘\n```\n\nOptimized:\n\n```text\n┌────────────┬─────────────┬─────────────┬──────────────┐\n│ Files      │    Time/Run │     mWd/Run │     mjWd/Run │\n├────────────┼─────────────┼─────────────┼──────────────┤\n│        100 │     11.45us │      6.21kw │       11.78w │\n│      1,000 │    129.36us │     57.41kw │    2_003.25w │\n│     10,000 │  2_053.18us │    570.41kw │   97_530.44w │\n└────────────┴─────────────┴─────────────┴──────────────┘\n```\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonio Nuno Monteiro <anmonteiro@gmail.com>",
