          "id": "0cf89b7bc6e9b3a0c52352aee053f27876894188",
          "message": "perf(cli): cache unchanged build status lines (#15689)\n\nThe scheduler repeatedly asks the live status line to render unchanged\nprogress and job counts. In a cold self-build, 10,391 of 21,692 renders\nrepeated the previous state.\n\nCache the immutable `Pp.t` until one of those counters changes. This\nreduced minor allocation by 2.37M words (18 MiB) in a cold self-build.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
