          "distinct": true,
          "id": "4f42785dc0c569e32cbb7ba6693879b08e2eedc1",
          "message": "perf(ordering): inline integer conversion (#15734)\n\nLow-level comparators frequently convert an integer comparison result to\n`Ordering.t`. Keeping the small conversion out of line adds avoidable\ncalls in these paths.\n\nMark `Ordering.of_int` as always-inline so callers can perform the two\ncomparisons directly. Repeated instruction-only Cachegrind profiles\nreduced warmed `@install` null-build instructions by about 0.14%, while\n`@check` remained effectively unchanged.\n\nThis is an internal implementation change and does not require a\nchangelog entry.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-09T12:43:22+01:00",
          "tree_id": "65f0fdad28184ff877059f9bdba5723a567f05fd",
