          "id": "9e9931f92efa7c4575076a7f126444e6ed4937fb",
          "message": "perf(stdune): validate filenames by length (#15736)\n\nFilename validation currently calls general string equality for both `.`\nand `..`, even though their lengths make those cases trivial to\ndistinguish.\n\nCheck the length and relevant characters directly before scanning for\n`/`.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
