          "id": "231ab88d9e46b0844912e9a168b89ca6f848362e",
          "message": "perf(lang): avoid rebuilding unchecked path comparators (#15735)\n\n`Module_name.Unchecked.Path.compare` is a partial application of\n`Nonempty_list.compare`, so its comparator closure is reconstructed at\ncall sites.\n\nEta-expand it to pass both paths directly. Repeated instruction-only\nCachegrind profiles of warmed `@install` and `@check` null builds\nimproved by approximately 0.02% on each target.\n\nThis is an internal implementation change and does not require a\nchangelog entry.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
