          "id": "4adc82c61fc2780f4328705ca1cf3d1b21f91e43",
          "message": "perf(lang): avoid rebuilding module path comparators (#15732)\n\n`Module_name.Path.compare` currently supplies the labeled element\ncomparator before its positional path arguments. The resulting partial\napplication is rebuilt at comparison sites.\n\nEta-expand the definition so calls go directly to\n`Nonempty_list.compare`. With release-built Dune executables, five-run\nmedian minor allocation on warmed null self-builds fell by 0.41% on\n`@install` and 0.94% on `@check`. Two matched instruction-only\nCachegrind comparisons were neutral on `@install` (-0.020% and +0.033%)\nand improved `@check` by 0.050% and 0.033%.\n\nThis is an internal implementation change and does not require a\nchangelog entry.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
