          "message": "test(stdune): expose repeated environment rendering (#15744)\n\nUpdating one variable in an `Env` currently rerenders assignments for\nunchanged variables. Add an expect test that records this allocation\nbehavior by checking physical identity across derived environments.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
