          "id": "f3746d92b68220af9b1d4220afd63cf557002990",
          "message": "feat(describe) Improve public/private name handling of libraries & executables (#15582)\n\n- Make public/private name handling of `executables` in `dune describe\nworkspace` and `dune describe external-lib-deps` consistent with\n`library`: public names are used where available\n- Add a `--split-public-names` flag to these commands, which places\nprivate names in the existing `name(s)` fields, and public names in a\nseparate `public_name(s)` field\n\nFixes #15497\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests added, if applicable.\n- [x] [Change log entry\nadded](../CONTRIBUTING.md#updating-the-changelog) for any user-facing\nchanges.\n- [x] Documentation added for any user-facing changes.",
