          "message": "perf(engine): create target directories after cache misses (#15747)\n\nMove target-directory creation after the workspace-local rule-cache\nlookup so cache hits do not issue redundant `mkdir` calls. The\nregression test was added separately in #15746.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
