          "id": "054913153fbe4e160f864ae3c26a09eabbfd7803",
          "message": "test: keep test state inside sandboxes (#15874)\n\nKeep test-generated state within per-test writable directories so\nsandboxed test actions do not attempt to write to user XDG directories\nor global `/tmp`.\n\nThis configures the blackbox environment’s XDG base directories, points\nthe dune-rpc-lwt test at its actual `XDG_DATA_HOME` registry location,\nand creates the external setup-script fixture under `$TMPDIR`.\n\nPreparatory for #15858.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
