          "message": "refactor(rocq): share rocqdoc option expansion (#15875)\n\nCompute the rocqdoc flags, header, and footer from one shared\n`Action_builder`. This avoids constructing separate expanders and keeps\nrocqdoc option expansion in one place.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
