          "message": "test(stdune): expose non-finite JSON numbers (#15877)\n\nAdd an expect test documenting that infinity, negative infinity, and NaN\nare currently serialized as invalid JSON tokens. This test-only change\ncaptures the existing behavior ahead of a follow-up fix.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
