          "id": "2d3cea1cb955d70c29ffafb32140a77867d65049",
          "message": "perf(memo): specialize trivial parallel combinators (#15869)\n\nReturn directly for empty and singleton parallel maps, iterations, and\nall-combinators. Such inputs have no parallel sections to collect and do\nnot need to inspect fiber-local dependency state.\n\nFocused singleton benchmarks improved parallel_map from 194ns/165 words\nto 191ns/156 words and parallel_iter from 192ns/159 words to 170ns/147\nwords.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
