          "id": "de9abcf00d9c014daa98c2579d1342fb11f92e70",
          "message": "fix(stdune): reject NUL bytes in environment variable names (#15881)\n\nValidate environment variable names when constructing `Env.Var.t`,\nrejecting embedded NUL bytes with a code error. This strengthens the\ninvariant established by making the type abstract and prevents invalid\nnames from reaching environment rendering.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
