          "id": "3c46b6fd6430075da8fd1d7eb04a5ecea80187fe",
          "message": "feat(trace): add opt-in Sat category and sat/solve event with stats (#15923)\n\nAdd an opt-in `sat` trace category that emits a `sat`/`solve` event with\nvariables, clauses, decisions, conflicts, and duration. Enable it with\n`DUNE_TRACE=+sat`.\n\nThis is preliminary observability work for the single-solve\npackage-solver effort.\n\nIncludes cram and expect-test coverage for the event and solver\ncounters.",
