          "id": "92830e8c64800be2c6c19cc05e67ad7acdbae1e5",
          "message": "test(rocq): expose missing native plugin layout entries (#16051)\n\n## Description\n\nExtend the Rocq plugin META cram test to inspect native plugin entries\nin the package-scoped layout created before `rocqdep`.\n\nThe current expectation deliberately snapshots the bug: the META file is\npresent while the `.cmxs` is absent, keeping the regression commit\ngreen. A follow-up fix will update the prose and expected output.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nPart of #16048. Rocq can discover a plugin META file in the scoped\nlayout while the corresponding native plugin has not been materialized.",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-20T09:36:07+02:00",
          "tree_id": "7309c0b7d78acf50d60ce53161a7f11450e11b04",
