          "message": "test(pkg): show avoid minimization is per-platform (#16042)\n\nIndependent pre-feature regression branch used by #15982.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Record that separate platform solves select platform-specific\navoid-version alternatives.\n- Show the resulting selection of two platform-specific packages instead\nof one common alternative.\n\nThe joint solver in #15982 minimizes distinct avoid-version package\nversions across the complete platform set and updates this expectation.\n\n## Checks\n\n- `dune runtest\ntest/blackbox-tests/test-cases/pkg/portable-lockdirs/portable-lockdirs-minimize-distinct-avoids.t`\n- `CI=true dune build @fmt @check`",
