          "message": "test(pkg): reproduce duplicate platform failures (#16041)\n\nIndependent pre-feature regression branch used by #15982.\n\n## Summary\n\n- Record the current duplicate-result merge failure when a requested\nplatform appears twice.\n- Record that failed per-platform solving reports the duplicate platform\ntwice.\n\nThe joint solver in #15982 deduplicates the requested platform set and\nupdates these expectations.\n\n## Checks\n\n- `dune runtest\ntest/blackbox-tests/test-cases/pkg/portable-lockdirs/portable-lockdirs-duplicate-platforms.t`\n- `CI=true dune build @fmt @check`",
