          "id": "7118b47ed31bc6922fa1d5708a7e9947b6645511",
          "message": "fix(memo): invalidate nodes before clearing caches (#16068)\n\nMemo table cache clearing removed entries before invalidating their\nnodes. Existing dependencies consequently retained detached nodes, while\nlater filesystem events invalidated newly-created entries that could no\nlonger propagate changes through the active graph.\n\nInvalidate every table entry while it remains reachable, then clear the\ntable. The queue-overflow reproducer added in #16060 now expects the\nsubsequent build to observe the new file.\n\nFixes #16052.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-21T11:41:15+01:00",
          "tree_id": "19a5f1f78283cfabe5a1f0f7b1fe3f1262baffe6",
