          "distinct": true,
          "id": "96f70b0ccb251e1bd503ab31d34ab4d058c38a22",
          "message": "perf(stdune): append validated path components directly (#16079)\n\n`Filename.t` now guarantees a valid path component on every platform, so\nthe `Path.relative_fname` family can append it directly instead of\nconverting and reparsing it. This also removes the unused `error_loc`\noptional argument from these functions.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-21T23:01:06+01:00",
          "tree_id": "1dc06b776ed96b5fc1b708a86110545f33d9fe29",
          "url": "https://github.com/ocaml/dune/commit/96f70b0ccb251e1bd503ab31d34ab4d058c38a22"
