          "id": "e7d87c42cbc6dbd9393558cf7fcccfa9c8526ba7",
          "message": "refactor(stdune): return filenames from directory reads (#16081)\n\nReturn directory entries as `Filename.t` from `Readdir` so callers can\nconsume them without revalidating path components. Filter `.` and `..`\nin the low-level Unix and Windows readers, and propagate the typed\nentries through existing callers.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
