          "id": "5733f5b484c2865b40563ef65b9657c66e046e40",
          "message": "perf: build qualified group closures with one traversal (#16087)\n\nBuild qualified-group dependency closures with a reverse accumulator,\navoiding intermediate subtree lists and quadratic copying for nested\ngroups.\n\nLocal benchmarks show 13.9% lower time for 1,024 flat modules and a 5.2x\nspeedup at nesting depth 128. The benchmark harness is not included.\n\nBuilds on #15752, which batches qualified dependency lookup.\n\nSigned-off-by: Antonio Nuno Monteiro <anmonteiro@gmail.com>",
