          "message": "refactor(describe): share build context setup (#16114)\n\nSeveral `dune describe` subcommands repeated scheduler startup,\nbuild-system initialization, and build-context lookup. Centralize that\nsetup in `Build.describe` so each command only supplies its memoized\ndescribe operation.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
