          "id": "1920583446895cc2ebebbe47b8d6570a1a73069d",
          "message": "perf(cram): share stanza dependency evaluation (#16096)\n\nWhole-subtree Cram stanzas can apply to tests in many directories.\nMemoize their expanders and dependency builders by the defining\ndirectory instead of recreating them for every matching test, while\npreparing them lazily so unmatched stanzas do no extra work. This\nreduces null-build time for the blackbox `test-cases` runtest alias by\nroughly 15–20%.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
