          "message": "fix(stdune): reject non-finite JSON numbers (#16115)\n\nJSON does not permit NaN or infinite numeric values, but the encoder\ncurrently emits invalid `nan`, `inf`, and `-inf` tokens. Reject\nnon-finite floats with a code error instead.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
