          "message": "perf(stdune): use memchr to validate spawn arguments (#16117)\n\nEvery process invocation validates the working directory, executable,\nand argument strings for embedded NUL bytes. Replace the OCaml\nbyte-by-byte scan with an allocation-free C stub using libc `memchr`,\nwhile preserving the existing validation errors.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
