          "message": "test(stdune): cover blank-separated words (#16118)\n\nAdd regression coverage for extracting words from empty and blank-only\nstrings, as well as inputs containing tabs, repeated separators, and\nsurrounding blanks. This establishes the behavior before specializing\nthe scanner.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
