          "id": "b1def784c87f37d5774d15799565a25c9c79c36e",
          "message": "perf(stdune): reuse validated canonical path components (#16120)\n\n`Path.Local.t` already guarantees that its slash-separated components\nare valid filenames. Avoid validating those components again in\n`basename`, `explode`, and `split_first_component`, and reuse the\ncanonical suffix returned by the latter directly.\n\nGeneral filename construction continues to use the checked APIs; the\nunchecked conversion is limited to boundaries where the local-path\ninvariant provides the validation.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-23T11:27:05+01:00",
