          "message": "fix(test): handle non-boolean CI environment values (#16097)\n\n## Summary\n\n- compare `CI` and `INSIDE_NIX` explicitly against `false`\n- avoid boolean decoding failures when those environment variables\ncontain non-boolean values\n\n## Testing\n\n- not run (test-stanza condition only)",
