          "id": "1d6ca9f04442bf9293739b7e0b15ec6d120dc98a",
          "message": "test(ocaml): demonstrate top-module subdirectory path bug (#16134)\n\nAdd a regression test recording the current failure when `dune ocaml\ntop-module` is invoked from the module's directory with workspace root\ndetection enabled.\n\nThe test shows that the relative module path is interpreted from the\nworkspace\nroot rather than the directory where Dune was started. It is test-only\ngroundwork\nfor sharing module-path resolution with `dune ocaml inferred-mli`.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
