          "message": "refactor(utop): use shared source path handling (#16136)\n\nUse `Common.source_path`, introduced in #16135, to resolve the directory\npassed\nto `dune utop`.\n\nThis removes the command's separate relative/absolute localization logic\nwhile\npreserving support for relative paths and absolute paths inside the\nworkspace.\nPaths outside the workspace now use the shared source-path error.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
