          "id": "5d91ec0ec8c0446e2ec82a88304f24ae06c8123c",
          "message": "test(pkg): snapshot host platform selection in build contexts (#16167)\n\n## Description\n\nAdd a focused regression scenario for build-time conditional package\nselection when a lock stanza overrides the host platform through\n`solver_env`.\n\nThe test records the current bug: on a Linux host, a lock stanza\nselecting macOS still causes the package's Linux build command to run. A\nfollow-up fix can change the expected result from `Linux` to `Darwin`.\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nThis isolates the existing build-context behavior before changing how\nthe effective solver environment is computed.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests added.\n- [ ] Change log entry added, if required.\n- [ ] Documentation added, if required.",
