          "id": "b2b24d7ab4a7ec7551f8cb1f7452d74805691c73",
          "message": "fix(stdune): enforce compact position field bounds (#16180)\n\nValidate compact-position fields against their actual bit masks,\nincluding rejecting negative values, before encoding them.\n\nThis prevents boundary values from being truncated and lets same-line\nlocations fall back to the wider encoding. Extend the compact-position\ntests to cover both cases.",
