          "id": "cf73c7f8e7d1ae451ff589975a3b5470bb060417",
          "message": "perf(blake3): mark reset as noalloc (#16208)\n\n`Blake3_mini.reset`'s C stub only mutates an existing hasher and returns\n`Val_unit`; it neither allocates on the OCaml heap nor raises. Mark its\nbinding\n`[@@noalloc]` so native callers use the optimized external-call\nconvention.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-25T23:01:21+01:00",
