          "message": "refactor(stdune): use Filename.null for dev null (#16261)\n\nUse OCaml's platform-specific `Filename.null` rather than maintaining a\nduplicate `Sys.win32` conditional. Expose the existing value through\n`Stdune.Filename` and use it directly at both dev-null call sites.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
