          "message": "test(engine): reproduce spawn failure capture leaks (#16259)\n\nAdd a cram regression that keeps Dune alive after an executable\ndisappears\nimmediately before spawning. The snapshot shows that both stdout and\nstderr\ncapture files remain in Dune's temporary directory until shutdown.\n\nThis intentionally records the current faulty behavior for a follow-up\ncleanup\nfix.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
