          "id": "c9805c16ee8edd7fef22a772001f8314c579805e",
          "message": "feat(action-plugin): run dynamic-run over RPC (#16256)\n\nReplace the temporary-file handshake used by `dynamic-run` with Dune RPC\nrequests. Keeping the plugin alive preserves process state while Dune\nbuilds newly discovered dependencies and avoids restarting the\nexecutable.\n\n- Expose the monad-parametric client as `Dune_rpc.V1.Action_plugin` and\nits Lwt implementation as `Dune_rpc_lwt.V1.Action_plugin`, removing the\ndedicated action-plugin packages.\n- Record RPC-served dynamic dependency facts in the existing action\nresult while preserving standalone execution.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-06T15:13:04+01:00",
