          "id": "8f5cde285b0496540c710b784dd00d04ebd3adc9",
          "message": "test(action-plugin): reproduce indirect dependency-cycle deadlock (#16341)\n\nAdd a bounded regression for an indirect cycle: a `dynamic-run` action\nrequests a second target whose rule depends on the first.\n\nThe test records the current timeout. Building dependencies from the RPC\nhandler loses the action’s Memo cycle-detection context, so Dune hangs\ninstead of reporting the cycle.\n\nIgnore nondeterministic shutdown output only when a build times out.\nPreserve diagnostics and exit statuses for all other outcomes.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-06T17:32:24+01:00",
          "tree_id": "761e0c2c733ee4e3c4fa031ff4cc715aa01fcf44",
