          "id": "9e8ad379c712d4c8b2c47220980f73d5af4b8494",
          "message": "test(action-plugin): cover multiple clients initializing one action (#16360)\n\nRecord that a second RPC client can initialize using the ID of an action\nthat is still running.\n\nThis is not necessarily a bug. We may choose to support multiple\nindependent clients within one action, allowing libraries to discover\ntheir own dependencies without sharing a client handle.\n\nTest only: this records existing initialization behavior without\ndeciding the session-ownership policy or changing the implementation. It\ndoes not test dependency requests from the second client.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
