          "id": "d17b81a273f1abf63c3a226b7e3eb10c0f135d0e",
          "message": "fix(action-plugin): honor stdout redirection (#16376)\n\nForward the `dynamic-run` action’s stdout destination to `Process.run`,\nalongside stdin and stderr. This makes `with-stdout-to` write the\nplugin’s output to the requested target instead of Dune’s terminal.\n\nUpdate the regression from #16355 to check that the target contains the\nexpected text. Combined terminal output alone had hidden the\nempty-target bug.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
