          "message": "refactor(stdune): move RPC conversion combinators to Stdune (#16383)\n\nMake the bidirectional S-expression codec available as `Stdune.Conv`\nwithout depending on `dune-rpc`. Move version handling and schema-digest\ngeneration with it, preserving existing behavior and wire formats.\n\nUpdate callers to use `Stdune.Conv` and remove the RPC conversion module\nand re-export.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
