          "message": "refactor(rpc): use Pid.t in registry entries (#16398)\n\nUse `Pid.t` for RPC registry entries and their construction, with shared\ncomparison and conversion helpers. Keep the `pid` accessor and\nserialized representation integer-based.\n\nNote that we are still careful not to leak any Stdune types in the\npublic API of Dune_rpc\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
