          "message": "refactor(rpc): derive address and registry diagnostics from Repr (#16401)\n\nFollow up on #16398 by exposing `Where.repr` and `Pid.repr` and using\nstructured representations for RPC address and registry-entry\ndiagnostics. Replace the hand-written registry comparison with\n`Repr.Poly`.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
