          "id": "a584bab1a6f4816a757ce9f11420261f1cee3efe",
          "message": "test(action-plugin): cover multiple dynamic invocations (#16400)\n\nExtend the composition fixture with generated inputs in distinct working\ndirectories and rebuild attempts after changing a discovered dependency.\nA single-invocation control succeeds; sequential and concurrent\ncompositions are tested separately so one rejection cannot mask the\nother. Retain coverage of rejection while loading an unrelated alias.\n\nRelated to #5681.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
