          "id": "19c5bb8b392e781e3171d1180e5e031e818b8f9b",
          "message": "feat(stdune): add scoped temporary-file descriptors (#16397)\n\nAdd `Temp.with_temp_file_fd` to retain the write-only creation\ndescriptor with scoped close/unlink cleanup, leaving the existing\npath-only API unchanged. Add `Io.write_fd` to reuse complete writes\nwhile preserving I/O metrics.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-13T18:50:26+01:00",
