          "message": "Add User Stories for Dune Tools (#16352)\n\n<!-- Thank you for contributing to dune!\n\n For general guidelines on contributing to dune, see\nhttps://github.com/ocaml/dune/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#developing-dune\n-->\n\n## Description\n\nThis is a draft list of user stories for tools, from the perspective of\nusers. Opening a PR early to get opinions from collaborators, but any\nthoughts are welcome!\n\n## Related Issue and Motivation\n\nFixes #15546.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Tests added, if applicable.\n- [x] [Change log entry\nadded](../CONTRIBUTING.md#updating-the-changelog) for any user-facing\nchanges.\n- [x] Documentation added for any user-facing changes.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Sudha Parimala <sudharg247@gmail.com>",
