          "id": "3086966df19f0bb19a348e2d430325b95756a89d",
          "message": "fix(cache): distinguish missing metadata from read errors (#16422)\n\nFix the metadata read-error misclassification demonstrated in #16408.\n\nRead cache metadata as binary canonical S-expressions and treat only\n`Unix.ENOENT` as missing. Preserve other IO errors instead of hiding\nthem behind `Not_found_in_cache`, and remove the obsolete `Sys_error`\nhandling.\n\nUpdate the cram regression to expect `EISDIR` when the metadata path is\na nonempty directory.\n\nSigned-off-by: Rudi Grinberg <me@rgrinberg.com>",
