          "id": "25576904abcc56715f564b93ddf2a5a4465ba8ae",
          "message": "fix(package-deps): follow library-induced package closure (#16362)\n\nInclude whole packages reached through library dependencies and track\ninstalled file changes. For packages in the lock directory, we have no\neasy way of getting the libraries directly, so instead we use the direct\npackage closure which is already computed.\n\n- Fixes https://github.com/ocaml/dune/issues/15511\n\nWhen we start loading sources directly, this distinction with the old\n\"package universe\" will no longer exist, so I think its fine for it to\nwork like this for now.",
